<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">YOA-NGƆMBƐ- BONDJALE</book>
  <para style="h">YOANI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Yoane</para>
  <para style="toc2">YOANE</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Yoane</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Yoane</para>
  <para style="imt">Eingeli e buku</para>
  <para style="ip">Edaka mokanda momɔti moyou mo banɛi mopamaka Bwɛndi Bopele bo mopɔsɔlu Yoane. Yo mɛnɛ aibopaka kombe endolo aboanaka bosipoa midjɔ bobeama bo nde «Motingami yona opalaka Yesu» etingodjaka mokanda mu 21, 20, 24. Modjɔ motina.</para>
  <para style="is">Modjɔ motina</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛndi manɛi mapele, bua bo Yoane bodi bo mbangi mɛnɛ. Na bea, bodi na midjɔ mikokanake na mia makina masato, elenge mosala mo Yoane Mobatisi, bobakeama bo mapa, bobenganama bo baibi ta tepelo kaoko ndjea e enɔngi, ta boyaka bosuka ta ekulusu. Enakobea midjɔ mimina misusu mibɔngedjamaka ko bokokedjama na ndjea e mabɔngedji i madaka pɛ bokɔmɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bwɛndi Bopele bobangaka na ndjea e ndjembo ipaka bodipoama bo Bwɛndi Bopele 1, 1-18, 51: «Mo» mobalo mo seko mo Ndjakomba, mobolamaka ta tei e Yesu, amoendja bosoti bo Ndjakomba. Bokimana bimbete: bwɛndi bo «bimbete» ko bwɛndi bo «Ehole».</para>
  <para style="ip">Bwɛndi bo «Bimbete» 1, 19-12, 50 edipaka songe banɛnɛ, ndele ekina nongo bianga bisato. Ebangaka na ndjea e tati e Yoane Mobatisi. Ngɔngɔ mida minɛnɛ mi bohelama bo badimi i bapinga: Nikodɛmɛ mokomi o mobeko (adaka na posa e isungi mɛnɛ tine bodima bo nde), mosamalia (aidimaka pɛpɛ ko dongedja oko bopa tati), adaka moto monɛnɛ (mobalo mo Yesu pɛ mokokaka na nde). «Bimbete» bo bɛnɛ, badaka bo sambo, babalaka bo basusu mooeka omɔti diko i Yesu: mana ma kanana 2, 1-11, 25, bohela bo mwana o moto monɛnɛ 4, 46-43, 54 ko bua bo yona o ondɔkɔ mako ta Betepasa 5, 1-18, 47, bobakeama bo mapa 6, 1-14, 20, bodala ta diko i ibeke 6, 16-21, 71, ndjɛnɛ epamaka adi moto o miso mago donga bobotama 9, 1-17, 41 ko bopusoa bo Ladjalo 11, 1-44, 57. Endolo boimedjaka bogbɔtodjama.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bwɛndi bo «ehole» 13, 1-20, 31 bobolaka diko i masu masuka. Ehole emina edi yena e ekulusu kaoko enɛmɛdja na molɔngɔ mi diko i bopala Ndjakomba tina e biso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekenge e boso 13, 1-17, 38: ta ehole eyekabo mia ma suka, Yesu akinaka adi batingami yena edaka elenge moda mo mobalo mosuka mo nde ko aongɔnɔkɔ Ndjakomba Sange e nde tine bobo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekenge e babae 18, 1-19, 40: apeama, asamba, abakamaka ta ekulusu, Yesu ainedjaka moda mo nde mo bokumu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekenge e basato (20): meako mikɔmɔkɔ ta pasika mikamodjaka batinagami. Ekenge e mbangi (21) eanedji mosala mosumamake na Piɛlɛ ko na «Motingami yona opalamaka na Yesu.» Naboenɛ moda mokomayo ko moda mo ekomeli eyu, mokanda momina moikomamaka bopele. Yoane ahɔkɔ ndambo e masolo, amaimedjaka ko amambilimedjaka. Kaoko na bopele bo bonɔ ibua botubaka bakɔmɛli. Ekɔmɔkɔ na bikenge binɛnɛ, ndjembo ko midjiki mi boinedja Kanana, mwali mosamalia, Ladjalo, Yesu adimaka boo abalaka na nange nde ko adi motingami opalakayo, Malia Mandɛɛni ta ikila, ko midjɔ mikina. Embete e molehi edaka popo tengasa Yoane aimeaka ta suka e boleha elenge popo o bokumu akaime ta suka e makoki. Odi boda pɛ bodima ta boso bo «bimbete» bi mohelo mopama na ndjea e Kilito? Odi bosipoa «Embete» ebolama ta tine bokumu bo Ndjakomba, ebalaka ekulusu? Bobongoana bokɔmɔ ta ndanda e Yesu, olomama na Sange e nde, batinagami, bolomamaka na ndjea e Yesu, ko iso bɛnɛ, basangoi ba nde. Moda momɔti na bu, iso lodiaka Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. Ladjebaka boo Kilito, Mwana o Ndjakomba, edi mɛnɛ Yesu 20, 31. Donga ena, loboani bodima, bohelama, Bopala ko bopa tati.</para>
  <para style="is">Tine bokɛ bohali mɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Bopele bo eleho e banɛi e Bwɛndi Bopele lotaboana bobosa mandi ma isolo i yu. Bodi oko na ndjea e bopa mɛngɔ minɛnɛ mi Yesu ta Yelusalɛmɛ, tine tɛkɛ e bayuda e pasika kaoko yena e bitondo. Edi eboanamake oko yo buki «Boihwea» ebalamaka na Matayo, Malako, Luka. Na ndjea ekina, loboani bodjeba boo, meako mikɔkɔ bayuda (ko naikina pongono, mibɔngɔkɔ nongo, eboanaka oko bolɛdjɛ adi Nikodɛmɛ) eidaka elone e bato basusu ba bayuda. Elenge ta tine Bwɛndi Bopele bo Matayo, lodi ena na meako mikɔɔmɔkɔ ta tei e bayuda ko bakilito ta suka e bianga koto mokama momɔti ta ehole e biso. Enakobea ta ehole ye boo Bwɛndi Bopele bo Yoane boenɛmi, ta Adjia ekɛkɛ, na bombilimedjama mɛnɛ. Ta midjɔ mimina, epamaka na tati e yu mɛnɛ e motingami yona oikɔkɔ ta midjɔ miendji Yesu ko na Sange e nde yona odi o diko.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="p">Mobalo mokapɛ bohu ko bomɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ta mbangi e leka losusu, Mobalo adaka ehele;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:1">Mobalo adaka engbanga na Ndjakomba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:1">Ko Mobalo adaka Ndjakomba.<verse eid="JHN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Soti, ta mbangi eleka losusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:2">Mobalo adaka engbanga na Ndjakomba <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja molɔngɔ mo 1-2 ko Mas 8, 22-26.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Na ndjea e Mobalo, leka losusu loduama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:3">Pɛ nongo eka eda pɛ boduama na ndjea e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokokanedja ta Mba 1, 3; Ndj 33, 6-9; 1Bik 8, 6; Kol 1, 16-17. </char></note> .<verse eid="JHN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">1, 4 </char>
    </note>Ta tei e Mobalo bomɔ bodaka <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pɛ eka eyoama napɛ bokɔmɔ na nde ta molɔngɔ mo 3; ilokɔmɔkɔ ehele lodaka na bomɔ ta tei e nde </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina bimbete bi mokanda bitikoanake na mokanda mo gɛlɛki </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Pɛ ekina eka edaka eda pɛ boyoama na nde. A tei e nde adaka bomɔ.</char></note>;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:4">Na bea bomɔ bomina bodaka bohu tina e bato.<verse eid="JHN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Endolo bohu bongɛsɛ ta modidi ko modidi moihɔnɔ bomodipa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Modidi baimodimea </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Modidi moipalaka bo mobalɔnde.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Moto omɔti aimaka, kombe e nde Yoane, yo alomama na Ndjakomba <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edaka Yoane Mobatisi. Endja pongono ta 1, 19-36.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Aduaka elenge tati e bohu, tine bosipodja bato basusu badime na ndjea e nde. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yo mɛnɛ aidaka bohu, endolo aduaka bopa tati tina e bohu.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Bohu bomina bodaka bohu bosoti, ibua ehole eduabo ta ngondo, boinedja bohu adi bato basusu.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Mobalo adaka ehele ta ngondo, ko ngondo eduama na ndjea e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Molɔngɔ mo 3.</char></note>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:10">Nongo bea bato ba ngondo baimodjebaka.<verse eid="JHN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Mobalo aduaka adi bato ba nde mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na ngando e nde mɛnɛ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kaoko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Adi yo, ta ngondo edaka e nde.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:11">Endolo bato ba nde baimoasɔ.<verse eid="JHN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Na bea, bato ibamoasɔkɔ, bamodimeaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:12">Abapaka kpatsi e boimea bana ba Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Bag 3, 26; 1 Yoa 3, 1-2.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Baimeaka bana ba Ndjakomba te na moda mo bobotama bo makia, kaoko na bopala bo bato; endolo edi Ndjakomba abapaka mohelo moyanie.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Mobalo aimeaka moto</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:14">Ko ahelamaka ta tei e biso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:14">Alumaka na mongandi ko na soti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:14">Iso loenɛ ekumu e nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:14">Ekumu e Mwana o ikinda olomama na Sange e nde.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yoane apaka tati tina e nde. Adumbeaka: «Edi na yona obalaka na mbi: “Yona aduake ngɔngɔ i mbi, anɔini na ekumu enɛnɛ, tengasa adaka ehele boso bo mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1, 30.</char></note>!”»<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Ta tei e bodieli bo nde bonɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:16">Iso basusu lodihi enɔeli e mongandi ngɔngɔ i mongandi.<verse eid="JHN 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Ndjakomba alopaka mobeko na ndjea e Mose<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 31, 18; 34, 28.</char></note>; endolo enɔeli e mongandi ko soti loduaka na ndjea Yesu Kilito. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Pɛ nongo moto oenɛ Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Boi 33, 20.</char></note>. Dongedja oko Mwana o ikinda, odi Ndjakomba okadikame mbuti na Sango, oko yo mɛnɛ aloinedja Ndjakomba.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tati e Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:1-8">Mal 1, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3, 1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Bakondji ba bayuda ibadaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ, balomaka banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na balewi, tine bohɔdjɔ Yoane: «Wɛ odi nda?» Endja pongono tati e Yoane. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yo ailona bobasɔmbedja, endolo adima bohu ta boso bo bobo ko ta miso ma bato basusu: «Naditi Kilito.» <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Bamohodjɔkɔ: «Wɛ odi mɛnɛ nda? Odi Elia?» – Abasɔmbedja: «Ngasa naditi Elia.» – Bamohɔdjɔkɔ naikina: «Ibeako odi mbaeli o Ndjakomba?» Asɔmbedjaka: «Ngasa!» <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Na bea babalaka na nde: «Wɛ mɛnɛ odi nda? Tine bo lobwani bosɔmbedja adi ibia balolomi. E bali wɛ nde ta tina e wɛ mɛnɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yoane asɔmbedjaka:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">«Nadi “moholi mo moto yona adumbeaka ta etengelenge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">Bɔngedjani ndjea e Kumu eime bodjo!”»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">Moda mobalaka mbaeli o Ndjakomba Isaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ta ndanda e bia ibalomamaka adi Yoane, badaka Bapalusai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makoma makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Balomami i balomamaka adi Yoane badaka Bapalusai.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Bamohɔdjɔkɔ naikina: «Wɛ oditi Kilito, oditi Elia, oditi Mbaeli o Ndjakomba, edɛdi wainaka tina nda?» <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yoane abasɔmbedjaka: «Mbi, nainakini na madiba; endolo ta tei e bino odini na moto omɔti wadaka no pɛ bodjeba. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Yona aduake ngɔngɔ i mbi; nadi moto ngasa ta boso bo nde, nabwaniti bolodja ngɔli i sapato i nde.» <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Midjɔ mimina minɔmɔkɔ ta ngando e Betania<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Betania </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ngando eidjebana ta dɔngɔ li sadiko li Yolodane; etikwani na ngando edi na kombe emɔti na yena edi mbuti na Yelusalɛmɛ (Endja 11, 1).</char></note>, ta dɔngɔ ikina i duwa e Yolodane, oho edaka polo einaka Yoane.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu, Mwana o bhata o Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Aya busa, Yoane aenɛ Yesu bodua adi yo. Abalaka: «Endjani Mwana o bhata o Ndjakomba okadongedje mabe ta ngondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 53, 6-7.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Edi yona obalaka mbi tina e nde: “Moto omɔti aduake ngɔngɔ i mbi, endolo adi na ekumu enɛnɛ bonɔ mbi, tengasa yo adaka ehele boso bo mbi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Mbi mɛnɛ naimodjebaka, endolo mbi nainaka na madiba, bɛngi na modjebedje adi bato ba Isalɛlɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yoane apaka tati ye naikina ta tina e nde: «Naeni Mwembo mo Ndjakomba motita ta busa elenge embenga ko bobakama ta diko i nde, naenɛkɛ meako mimina mbi mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 11, 2; 61, 1.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Naimodjebaka, endolo Ndjakomba yona olomani boina na madiba, abalaka na mbi: “Wenɛke Mwembo botita ko bobakama ta diko i moto omɔti; edi yona abatisake na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Mbi mɛnɛ naeni meako mimina ko napaka tati bo yo adi Mwana o Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batingami ba boso ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Ngɔngɔ i isu imɔti naikina, Yoane adaka naikina oko ta polo emina, na batingami ba nde babae. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Ehole enɛkɛ yo Yesu bonɔ, abalaka: «Endjani Mwana o bhata o Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja </char></note>!» <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Ehole eoka batingami ba babae ba Yoane mobalo momina, bakimana Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu ahombana ko aeni bato bamokimane. Abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Ahombaka no nde?» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Labi adikamaka wɛ djɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Labi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kombe e alameyɛ.</char></note>?» – Kombe emina etingodji «Molehi.» – <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Abasɔmbedjaka: «Duani ko wɛnɛkeni.» Bakɛ, baenɛ polo edaka yo adi ko bada na nde busa bomina. Edaka mbuti na bihole binɛi ngɔngɔ i midi. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Omɔti ta tei e babae ibadaka baoka mobalo mo Yoane ko bakimanaka Yesu, edaka Andele, mwange Simo Piɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Moto o boso osakanaka na Andele, edaka mwange e nde Simo; abalaka na nde: «Lotanei Masiya.» Kombe emina etingondji «Kilito». <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ko akɛ na Simo mbuti na Yesu. Yesu amoendja ko abalaka: «Wɛ odi Simo, mwana o Yoane; baobeake edɛdi Kipasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kepasi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kombe e alameyɛ.</char></note>» kombe emina etingondji «Piɛlɛ».<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilipo na Natanɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Ngɔngɔ i isu imɔti naikina, Yesu apalaka bokɛ ta ngando e Galilea. Asakanaka na Pilipo ko abalaka na nde: «Kimanani!» <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Pilipo adaka moto o ibonga i Betesaida<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Betesiada </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ibonga iendjanaka na Kapalanuama.</char></note>, ngando e Andele na Piɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Na bea, Pilipo asakanaka pongono na Natanɛlɛ ko abalaka na nde: «Losakani na yona obala Mose ta buku e Mobeko ko pongono yona obalaka ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba ta tina e nde <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dit 18, 18; Isa 9, 5-6; Edj 34, 23.</char></note>. Edi Yesu o ngando e Nasaleta, mwana o Esepu.» <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Eka epele ebwani boboloa ta Nasaleta nda?» Pilipo amosɔmbedjaka: «Dua ko wenɛke.» <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Ehole enɛ Yesu Natanɛlɛ bobatama mbuti na nde, abalaka na nde: «Endja mo Isalɛlɛ o soti mɛnɛ; boloa boditi ta tei e nde.» <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Na bea Natanɛlɛ amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Odjebini moda nda?» Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Noenɛki yana adaki wɛ ta nase i mole mo pigi, boso bo Pilipo aobe.» <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Na tina emina Natanɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Labi, wɛ odi soti mɛnɛ Mwana o Ndjakomba, odi Mokondji o Isalɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 2, 7; Sop 3, 15. </char></note>!» <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Odimi tine nabali na wɛ noenɛki yana adaki wɛ ta nase i mole mo pigi? Wenɛke naikina meako minɛnɛ bonɔ i mi!» <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Ko abakeaka: «Okobea, nabali na wɛ, edi soti: wenɛke busa bodipoama ko babwɛndji ba Ndjakomba boiweya ko botita diko i Mwana o Moto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 28, 12.</char></note>!»<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tɛkɛ e moki ta Kanana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ta isu i basato, edaka na tɛkɛ e moki ta Kanana, ta ngando e Galilea. Nange e Yesu adaka ena. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Babeaka pongono Yesu na batingami ba nde ta tɛkɛ e mina. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Ngɔngɔ i moehole omɔti, mana ma vino masiaka. Nange e Yesu abalaka na nde: «Baditi naikina na mana ma vino.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Endolo Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Mwali, modjɔ mo mbi na wɛ nda? <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwali </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endolo kɔpi e ba Gɛlɛki editi eboanake na isuma tine e boboana na makomi maninodjamake ta palasɛ. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Edi adi wɛ... Edi na mbi bokɔ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Apalaka wɛ na mbi nde?</char></note> Ehole e mbi ebwanakini.» <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Na bea nange e Yesu abalaka na basali: «Kɔni misusu mabalake yo na nu.» <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Enakobea edaka ena biseli bi mabanga bisakamoaka na bayuda, tine mida mi bobo mi bosasɛnodja. Engi eseli ekweaka bikpate mbuti na mokama. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu abalaka na basali: «Lumedjani madiba ta biseli bi.» Ko basali babilumedjaka botɔ. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Edɛdi lokani ko pani mobɔngedji o tɛkɛ.» Na bea ekɔmɔ oko bea. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Mobɔngedji o tɛkɛ ameka madiba imakindoa mana ma vino. Aidjeba dɔngɔ idonga mana ma vino emina, endolo basali ibalokaka madiba badjebaka. Mobɔngedji o tɛkɛ abeaka moswa tɛkɛ e moki <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />ko abalaka na nde: «Bato basusu bobangaka boso bopa mana ma vino epele, ngɔngɔ ehole elangoi bato ibabei yo, aimei bobapa imapɛ boda mapipo. Endolo wɛ, obombi mana ma vino epele mbunoko edɛdi!»<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Endja iye edi mbangi e bimbete bi boso bi ngindola ibikɔ Yesu ta Kanana ngando e Galilea. Na bea ainedjaka ekumu e nde ko batingami ba nde bamodimeaka. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ngɔngimina, akɛkɛ ta ngando e Kapalanauma engbanga emɔti na nange e nde, bange i nde ko batingami ba nde. Bayeyoaka oho baasu.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat 21, 12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mlk 11, 15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19, 45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Tɛkɛ e Pasika e bayuda aimeaka mbuti ko Yesu akɛkɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boi 12, 1-27.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Ta tepelo, ataneaka bato batɛkɛ ngɔmbɛ, bhata ko bimbenga. Ataneaka pongono basendji ba bibende bi palanga badi ta mesa i bobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mal 11, 15 Ko ta molongo.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Na bea, atombaka mobalake ko ababenganaka bato basusu sokolu e tepelo, na bhata ba bobo ko na ngɔmbɛ ba bobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abengana... Ngɔmbɛ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Abengana bo basusu </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Tito, </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bhata elenge ngɔmbɛ.</char></note>; asabakaka bibende bi palanga bi basendji ko bodumbakaka mesa i bobo. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Abalaka na batɛki ba bimbenga: «Dongedjani losusu iya! Pɛ boimedjani ndako e Sange e mbi ndako e mombongu!» <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Batingami ba nde balɛdjɛkɛ mibalo i mikomama: «Ikuwa idi na mbi tine e ndako e wɛ, oo Ndjakomba, langodjakeni elenge mosa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 69, 10.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Na bea bakondji ba bayuda bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Embete e ngindola ndani ebwani na wɛ bokɔ, ebɛngi olodimedje bo odi na kpati e bokɔ bea nda?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Bukani tepelo ye ko ngɔngɔ i masu masato naetongake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 26, 61; 27, 40; Mal 14, 58; 15, 29.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Bayuda babalaka na nde: «Ta botongama bo tepelo ye, eyeyoaka mbula tuku inɛi na basamano ko wɛ wetongake na masu masato!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Botongama bo tepelo ebangaka mbuti na mbula 20 boso bo Yesu Kilito. Ta ehole e Elode o mosuku.</char></note>» <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Endolo tepelo ebalaka Yesu, edaka mokuku mo nde mɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ta ehole epusowa Yesu ta tei e bago, batingami ba nde balɛdjɛkɛ meako imibalaka yo na bu; ko badimaka ikomi ko na mibalo imi batɔndeaka Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebaka misusu mi moto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ehole edaka Yesu ta Yelusalɛmɛ, ta ehole e tɛkɛ e Pasika, emumu e bato emodimeaka ta boenɛ bimbete bi ngindola ibikɔkɔ yo. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Endolo Yesu aibadimaka, tine abadjebaka bo basusu bopele mɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Aidaka na posa e bomotɔndea tati tine e moto, tengesa yo mɛnɛ adjebaka bopele eka ndani edaka ta tei e molema mo moto.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Isolo i Yesu na Nikodɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Edaka na momi omɔti kombe e nde Nikodɛmɛ. Yo adaka omɔti o basuku ba bayuda ta ikita i bapalusai. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Aduaka na bulu adi Yesu ko abalaka na nde: «Labi, lodjebi bo odi molehi yona odonga adi Ndjakomba. Tengasa pɛ moto obwani bokɔ bimbete bi ngindola elenge akɔkɔ wɛ, emiti da bo Ndjakomba adae engbanga na nde.» <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Okobea, nabali na wɛ, edi soti: moto abwaniti bodjeba meako mi Bokumu bo Ndjakomba amiti botama mbala e babae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbala e babae </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ebaeli e gɛlɛki etingodjaka pongono </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Odiko. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kombe ye edi na tingo ibae. Yoane asakamoaka na tingo imina isusu ibae.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodɛmɛ amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Moda ndani moto mosuku abwani bobotama mbala e babae? Asɔmbe naikina ta sɔpɔ i nango bɛngi abotame mbala e babae?» <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Okobea, nabali na wɛ, edi soti: moto abwaniti bokwea ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba amiti botama na madiba ko na Mwembo. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Yona obotami na moto adi moto; ko yona obotami na Mwembo adi mwembo. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Pɛ bokamoa tine bo naotɔndei: “Etungi na wɛ bobotama mbala e babae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbala e babae </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kaoko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ta o diko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta molɔngɔ mo 3.</char></note>.” <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Epoyipoyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta gɛlɛki, edi oko ebaeli einedjaka bo </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Lungu </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Mwembo. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Edi bea pongono makou mobalo ta ebaeli e molɔngɔ momina.</char></note> bonɔkɔ polo epalaka mo; okaka kilingo ekɔkɔ mo, endolo otadjebaka polo edongaka mo kaoko enɔkɔ mo. Endja eka enɔmɔke tine yona abotamake na Mwembo mo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Na bea Nikodɛmɛ amosɔmbedjaka: «Modjɔ momina modi bokɔmɔ moda nda?» <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Wɛ moto odi molehi odjebami ta Isalɛlɛ, otadjebaka midjɔ imi? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Okobea, nabalaka na wɛ, edi soti: iso labalaka meako madjebaka so ko lapaka tati e meako imenɛkɛ so, endolo otapalakani bodima tati e biso. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ehole eobaleakani mbi midjɔ mi ngondo otadimeakanini; moda ndani wadimeakenini ehole eobaleakeni mbi midjɔ mi busa? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Pɛ moto okɛ ta busa, dongedja oko Mwana o Moto yona otita ta busa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makoma makina maa </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Yona otitaka ta busa, Mwana o Moto yona odi ta busa. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mas 30, 4; Bal 10, 6.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Oko moda momina mongɔdjɔkɔ Mose ndjɔ ta etengelenge, oko moda momina Mwana o Moto atungi angɔdjɔme, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />tine bo yona amodimeake adihe mohelo mo seko. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Tengasa Ndjakomba apalaka bonɔ mɛnɛ bato ba ngondo, apaka Mwana o nde omɔti o ikinda, tine bomoto na moto yona amodimeake, adae pɛ bobunga endolo adihe mohelo mo seko. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Ndjakomba ailomaka Mwana o nde ta ngondo tine bosambedja bato; endolo tine boheledja bato ba ngondo na ndjea e nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Yona adimeake Mwana, atasambedjamake; endolo yona odɛi pɛ bomodimea, asambedjamabi; tine bo aidimea kombe e Mwana o ikinda o Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Endjani moda moenɛmɛke esambi: bohu aduaka ta ngondo, endolo bato ba ngondo bapalaka modidi bonɔ bohu, tine misala mi bobo midaka mibe. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Yona akɔkɔ bobe, alonaka bohu ko akasasue na bohu; tengasa abangaka misala mi nde mibe misakenɛmɛ ta bohu. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Endolo yona adalaka ta soti, akadue ta bohu, bɛngi misala mikasaleyo engbanga na Ndjakomba mienɛme bohu.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoane Mobatisi api tati tina e Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ngɔngɔ imina, Yesu na batingami ba nde bakɛkɛ ta mokpɔtɔ mo Yudea. Ayeyoaka mo ehole na bu, ko ainaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 4, 1-2.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yoane pongono ainaka ta moongando e Enɔi, mbuti na Salimi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enɔni </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Salimo </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ngando djibae dji polo epɛ bodjebana, ta idinda di Yolodani.</char></note>, tine oho madiba madaka manɛnɛ. Bato bakɛkɛ adi yo ko ababatisaka. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Tengasa Yoane aipakakwea ta bɔlɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 14, 3; Mal 6, 17; Luk 3.19-20.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Na bea busa bomɔti, kitɛ edaka ta tei e batingami ba Yoane na moyuda omɔti ta tina e mabɔngedji ma bosasɛnodja. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Bakɛkɛ botanea Yoane ko babalaka na nde: «Labi, wadjebaka naikina moto yona odaka na wɛ ta dɔngɔ i Yolodane, yona opaka wɛ tati? Endja ainaka edɛdi ko bato basusu bakɛkɛ adi yo!» <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yoane abasɔmbedjaka: «Moto abwaniti adie ikabo ta busa, emiti da bo Ndjakomba amopɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Inobɛnɛ odini batemo ba meako imabalaka mbi: “Naditi Kilito, endolo nalomamaka boso bo nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1, 20. Endja pongono ta Mal 3, 1.</char></note>.” <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mwali o moki adi tine momi omoasɔi. Endolo modjebani o momi adake mbuti na nde bomoka, adake na mongandi tine boka moholi mo yona oasɔi. Mongandi momina modi mo mbi, modi edɛdi mokokake. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Etungi ekumu e nde e we ko e mbi etite.»<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yona odonga ta busa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />«Yona odonga ta busa adi diko i losusu; yona odonga ta kpɔtɔ adi kpɔtɔ ko abalaka meako mi kpɔtɔ. Iyona odonga ta busa [adi diko i losusu]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta makomi makina ekenge ye enɛmi elenge imia midi ngɔngɔ molɔngɔ mo 27-30 kaoko botingodja bo mokomi.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Apaka tati e meako imenɛ yo ko imokaka yo, endolo pɛ moto odimaka tati e nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Yona odimaka tati bimbete bi nde, adimedjaka mɛnɛ bo Ndjakomba adi soti. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Tengasa yona olomaka Ndjakomba, bobalaka mibalo mi Ndjakomba; Ndjakomba amolumedja na Mwembo mo nde napɛ mwɛngi. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Sange moto akapale Mwana ko amopa losusu ta mɔmɔ ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Yona aisaka edimeli e nde adi Mwana adi na mohelo mo seko; yona alonaka bodimea Mwana adihetebi mohelo momina, endolo kɛlɛ e Ndjakomba adake adi yo.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Isolo i Yesu na mwali o Mosamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Bapalusai baokaka gala bo Yesu ainaka bato ko aimeaka na batingami banɛnɛ bonɔ Yoane. – <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Ta bosoti, Yesu yo mɛnɛ ainaka, edaka ndolo batingami ba nde bato babatisaka. – Ehole eokaka Yesu meako mimina, <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />adongaka ta ngando e Yuda ko asɔmbɔkɔ ta ngando e Galilea. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Enakobea, edaka bo akatise ta ngando e Samalia. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Aimeaka mbuti na ngando emɔti e Samalia, ebeakabo Sikale yena edaka mbuti na gbie e Djakobo, epaka yo na mwana o nde Esepu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mba 33, 19; Yos 24, 32.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Ena edaka mombɔndɔ mo madiba mo Djakobo. Yesu aembɛkɛ na mɔndɔ, asadedjaka ta yɔngɔ e mombɔndɔ mo madiba. Edaka mbuti na ehole e midi. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Mwali omɔti mo Samalia aduaka boloka madiba ko Yesu abalaka na nde: «Pani madiba na mwake.» <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Batingami ba nde bakɛkɛ ta ngando enɛnɛ asomba eka e boyaka. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Mwali Mosamalia abalaka na Yesu: «Wɛ odi Moyuda! Moda ndani wahɔdjɔkɔni nopɛ madiba ma bomwaka, mbi mwali mosamalia?» Na bea, bayuda tebokane na basamalia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Luk 9, 52-53.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Osodjeba ikabo i Ndjakomba ko yona aohɔdjɔkɔ madiba ma bomwaka, edaki wɛ moto omohɔdje madiba ma bomwaka ko abwanaki bopa madiba imakapɛ mohelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mohelo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Madiba imakapɛ mohelo. Etingodji na moda mokina</char><char style="fp" closed="false">Madiba imakatindoe. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Madiba ma mohelo </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ikabo labalaka Yesu idi pongono ikapɛ mohelo. Endja pongono ta molɔngɔ 14; Kokanedja 7, 37.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mwali omina asɔmbedjaka: «Tata, oditi na elokei e madiba ko mombɔndɔ mo madiba modi mombɛngɛ! Oboani bodiha madiba mamina makapɛ mohelo djɔ? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Kɔkɔ e biso Djakobo alopaka mombɔndɔ mo madiba mu; amwakaka yo mɛnɛ madiba mamina, bana ba nde bami ko na bingbɛndɛ bi nde bamwakaka pongono. Olɛdji bo wɛ onɔi Djakobo?» <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Yona omwaki madiba mi, aokake posa naikina; <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />endolo yona amwake madiba mamopake mbi, aoketebi naikina posa. Tengasa madiba mamopake mbi, maimeake adi yo momboka mokapɛ mohelo mo seko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 12, 3; 2, 13; 17, 13.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mwali abalaka na nde: «Tata, pani edɛdi madiba ma mina, bɛngi bo nadae pɛ boka posa e madiba naikina ko nadae pɛ boda na posa e bosɔmbɔ aloka madiba naikina iya!»<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Kɛ abe muma wɛ ko osɔmbe iya.» <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mwali omina amosɔmbedjaka: «Naditi na momi.» Yesu abalaka na nde: «Odi na elonga e bobala bo oditi na momi. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Tengasa odaka boso na bami batano ko momi odi na wɛ edɛdi, aditi ko muma wɛ. Na bea obali soti.» <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mwali omina akamoaka ko abalaka: «Tata, naeni bo wɛ odi mbaeli o Ndjakomba! <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Bakɔkɔ ba biso basamalia baongɔnɔkɔ Ndjakomba ta ikoli idi; endolo no bayuda okabaleni bo polo eboani na bokumedja Ndjakomba edi ta Yelusalɛmɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Basamalia bagbɔtɔ na iputo i bayuda. Na bea batonga tepelo e bobo ta diko i ikoli i Geladjimo; Enakobea bayuda badikaka ta tepelo e Yelusalɛmɛ.</char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 122, 1-4.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu amombedjaka: «Mwali dimeani, ehole eduake, okumedjetebini naikina Sesa ta ikoli idi, nongo ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Ino basamalia, okakumedjeni Ndjakomba okadɛno pɛ bodjeba; endolo iso bayuda lokakumedje Ndjakomba okadjebeso. Tengasa isiko idoi na bayuda. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Endolo ehole yena aduake ko esi boimea, ehole yena bakumedji ba soti bakumedjakabi Sesa na ndjea e Mwembo ko na soti; tengasa edi bakumedji bia bakahombe Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Ndjakomba adi Mwembo ko bia bakamokumedje, badi bomokumedja na ndjea e Mwembo ko na soti.» <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mwali omina abalaka na nde: «Nadjebaka bo Masiya, atingodjaka Kilito, aduabi. Ehole eduabi yo, aloinedjabi meako misusu.» <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Edi Mbi, iyo nabalaka na wɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Oko ta ehole emina, batingami ba Yesu bahulaka; bakamoaka bomoenɛ bosola na mwali. Endolo pɛ nongo omɔti ta tei e bobo obwanaka bomohɔdjɔ: «Apalaka yo nde?» Kaoko: «Asolakabo nde?» <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Na bea mwali omina akinaka eseli e nde ko asɔmbɔkɔ ta ngando botɔndea bato: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />«Duani aendjeni moto omɔti abaleini misusu mikɔkɔ mbi! Abwaniti boda ehole ekina Kilito?» <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Baimanaka ta ngando enɛnɛ ko baduaka botanea Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Oko ta ehole emina, batingami baongɔnɔkɔ Yesu: «Molehi yaka nongo moeka!» <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Endolo Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Miya maboani mbi boyaka, ino otamadjebakani.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Batingami basahɔdjɔkɔ ta tei e bobo: «Moto omɔti amopi mia ma boyaka?» <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Miya ma mbi madi: bokɔ bolulea bo yona olomani ko boimedja mbunoko suka, mosala mopani yo. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Ino okabaleni: “Ediki songe banɛi boso bo boo ehole e botswa mbuma boime”. Endolo mbi nabalaka na nu, endjani bopele mɛnɛ gbie: mbuma ipingi ehele ko imei mbuti na botswa! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Moto yona atswaka mbuma asadiedji iputi i nde ko abongoanedjaka mbuma tine mohelo mo seko. Na bea, edɛe yona onaka kaoko yona atswaka basepake engbanga. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Tengasa edi soti na isɛ labalaka: “Omɔti aoni ko okina atswi” <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Mbi naolomakani botswa ta gbie eda no pɛ bona; bakina baenɛ saya na bosala ko ino oheli na mosala mo bobo.»<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Basamalia banɛnɛ ba ngando emina badimeaka Yesu tine bo mwali abatɔndeaka: «Abaleini misusu mikɔkɔ mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Na tina emina, ehole eimeaka basamalia mbuti na nde, baongɔnɔkɔ Yesu bo adae na bu; na bea Yesu ayeyoa na bu masu mabae. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Ta tina e mibalo mibalaka Yesu na bu, bato bomodimeaka naikina badaka banɛnɛ bonɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Babalaka na mwali omina: «Edɛdi lodimiti tine meako milotɔndei wɛ; endolo tine looki iso bɛnɛ, ko losipoi bo adi soti mɛnɛ Moheledji o ngondo.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aheledji mwana o mosali monɛnɛ o mokondji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ngɔngɔ i bonɔdjɔ masu mabae ta polo emina, Yesu akɛkɛ ta ngando e Galilea. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yesu yo mɛnɛ abalaka: «Mbaeli o Ndjakomba takume ta ngando e nde mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja Mat 13, 57; Mal 6, 4; Luk 4, 24.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Na tina emina, ehole eimeaka yo ta ngando e Galilea, bato ba ngando e Galilea bamoasɔkɔ bopele. Tengasa bo pongono bakɛkɛ ta tɛkɛ e Pasika ta Yelusalɛmɛ ko baenɛkɛ meako misusu mikɔmɔkɔ ta ehole e tɛkɛ emina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 2, 23.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yesu asɔmbɔkɔ ta Kanana ta ngando e Galilea, oho asendjaka madiba mana ma vino. Edaka ena mosali monɛnɛ o mokondji, yona odaka na mwana o nde na epeko ta Kapalanauma. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ehole eokaka yo bo Yesu adongi ta Yuda aimei ta Galilea, akɛkɛ bomotanea ko amongɔnɔkɔ bo adue ta Kapalanauma tine boheledja mwana o nde momi, yona odaka na epeko epipo mbuti na bogwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Odimakabini seko oko okaenɛni bimbete bi ngindola kaoko bingengo!» <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Mosali monɛnɛ o mokondji abalaka na nde: «Kumu, dua pɛpɛlɛ adi mbi esada boo mwana o mbi agwɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Sɔmbɔ akadɛ wɛ, mwana o wɛ aheli.» Mosali monɛnɛ o mokondji adimaka mibalo mibalaka Yesu na nde ko ayanaka. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Iyana adaka yo ayane, basali ba nde baduaka bosakana na nde ko babalaka na nde: «Mwana o wɛ aheli!» <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Abahɔdjɔkɔ ehole ndani esokodjaka yo bopele. Ibo bamosɔmbedjaka: «Edaki mɔkɔ, ngonga e boso ngɔngɔ i midi, ehole emokinaka pɛpɛlɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Sange mwana asipoaka bo edaka oko ta ngonga yena ebalaka Yesu na nde: «Mwana o wɛ aheli.» Na bea yo na bato basusu ba ndako e nde badimeaka Yesu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bik 11, 14; 16, 14-15, 31.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Yena edaka embete e babae e ngindola ekɔkɔ Yesu, ngɔngɔ i ihule i nde ta Galilea donga ta Yuda <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 2, 11.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji momi omɔti o etumbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Ngɔngimina, Bayuda basepaka tɛkɛ ko Yesu akɛkɛ ta ngando enɛnɛ e Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ta ngando e mina, edaka na esoseli emɔti ebeakabo ta monɔkɔ mo baebele Beteseda. Edaka mbuti na ekukɛ e bhata ko ehikamaka na mbalasani imakwe matano <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beteseda </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makomi makina madi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Betesata.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Nase i mbalasani imina, emumu e bato ba bipeko, bagwa miso, bitumbɛ, na bato ba mitɛngu badaka basambi ena. [Bambaka bokumana bo madiba; <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />tengasa obwɛndji o Kumu adaka atita bihole na bihole bokumana madiba ma esoseli. Moto o boso o epeko osadumbaka ehole ekumanaka madiba, ahelaka na yogo e nde, nongo edaka moda ndani.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makoma imahangei bo ta tei e bigbanga bibae (suka e molɔngɔ mo 3 ko molɔngɔ mo 4) maditi ta makoma manɛnɛ mayou.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Edaka na momi omɔti o epeko ayeyoaka ena bianga tuku isato na bomwambe. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Ehole emoenɛkɛ Yesu asambi ta kpɔtɔ ko aoka gala bo ayeyoaka ena na epeko donga ehele, amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Wapalaka ohele?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Moto o epeko amosɔmbedjaka: «Kumu, naditi na moto obosabani ta esoseli ehole ekakumane madiba. Ehole ehombi mbi na kɛ, okina asasabi boso bo mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Angɔ, tomba itɔkɔ i wɛ ko dala.» <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Mbala emɔti, momi omina ahelaka; atombaka itɔkɔ i nde ko abangaka bodala. Na bea, modjɔ momina mokɔmɔkɔ ta busa bo sabata. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Bakondji ba Bayuda bahɔdjɔkɔ momi omina ohelaka: «Edi busa bo sabata, otungiti botomba itɔkɔ i wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Yil 17, 21; Nem 13, 19.</char></note>!» <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Abasɔmbedjaka: «Moto oheledjini abali na mbi: “Tomba itɔkɔ i wɛ ko dala.”» <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Na bea bamohɔdjɔkɔ naikina: «Moto obali na wɛ bea nda: “Tomba itɔkɔ i wɛ ko dala”?» <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Endolo momi omina ohelaka aimodjebaka, tengasa Yesu alɛmoaka ta emumu e bato yena edaka ta polo emina. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Ngɔngɔ i mooehole, Yesu asakanaka na nde ta tepelo ko abalaka: «Iya aheli wɛ edɛdi, angatana bo osakakɔ bobe naikina; esakadabo modjɔ mokina mobe bonɔ mosakotanea.» <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Momi omina akɛkɛ abala adi bakondji ba bayuda, edaka Yesu moto omoheledjaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Na tina emina bayuda baimeaka bonɔngedja Yesu, tine bo akɔkɔ modjɔ momina ta busa bo sabata. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Endolo Yesu abalaka na bu: «Sange e mbi adi oko ta mosala, mbi pongono nadi ta mosala.» <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Ta tina e mobalo mua, bakondji ba bayuda bahombaka naikina enɔeli e bowa Yesu, tengasa eidaka otobea tine aisumaka busa bo sabata, endolo abalaka pongono Ndjakomba adi Sange e nde mɛnɛ ko asakokanedjaka na Ndjakomba.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bokondji bo mwana o Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu asɔmbɔkɔ bobala na bu naikina: Okobea, nabali na nu, edi soti: Mwana abwaniti bokɔ eka emɔti na moda mo nde mɛnɛ; akɔkɔ oko imenɛkɛ yo na Sange e nde bokɔ, Mwana akɔkɔ oko moda momina. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Tengasa Sesa bopalaka Mwana ko bomoinedjaka imikakɔe yo. Amoinedjakabi misala minɛnɛ bonɔ imi menɛkɛno ko wakamoakeni bonɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Tengasa, oko moda momina Sesa akasisodje bago ko akabapɛ bomɔ, oko moda momina Mwana akapɛ bomɔ adi moto opali yo. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Ko Sesa tasambedjake moto, endolo apaka adi Mwana bokondji bosusu bo bosambedja, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />bɛngi bo bato basusu bakumedjake Mwana elenge akumedjaka bo Sesa. Yona adaka pɛ bokumedja Mwana, atakumedjaka pongono Sange e moto yona omolomaka. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />«Okobea, nabali na nu, edi soti: yona okaka mibalo mi mbi ko adimaka yona olomani, adihi bomɔ bo seko. Atadihabi esambi, endolo anɔ ehele ta bogwa na bomɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Okobea, nabali na nu, edi soti: ehole eduake, ko eimei edɛdi, bagwake baokabi kɔpi e Mwana o Ndjakomba ko ibia bamokakabi, badabi na mohelo. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Tengasa, elenge Sesa adi na mohelo mo nde yo mɛnɛ, oko moda momina apa adi Mwana makoki ma boda na mohelo mo nde yo mɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Ko apaka adi Mwana kpatsi e bosambedja, tine bo adi Mwana o Moto. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Pɛ bokamoani, tengasa ehole aduake, ibapuseamaka baokabi kɔpi e nde <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />ko baimabi ta makila ma bobo. Bia ibakɔkɔ bopele, bapusoabi tine bodiha bomɔ, endolo ibia ibakɔkɔ bobe bapusoabi tine bodiha esambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dan 12, 2.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Naboaniti bokɔ eka emɔti tina e mbi mɛnɛ. Nasambedjaka oko abalaka Ndjakomba na mbi ko esambi e mbi edi bodjo, tine bo natahombaka bokɔ eka na bopala bo mbi mɛnɛ, endolo na bopala bo yona olomani.»<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bapaka tati ipele tina e Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />«Ekada bo napaka tati tina e mbi mɛnɛ, tati emina etadake na tina. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Endolo edi okina apake tati tina e mbi ko nadjebaka bo tati emina edi soti. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Olomakani balomami adi Yoane ko yo apaka tati e soti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edaka Yoane mobatisi, Endja 1, 19-27; 3, 22-30.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Mbi, naditi na tina e tati e moto; endolo nabalaka bea bɛngi oheleni. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yoane adaka elenge molinda mowanedjakabo tine mopɛ bohu. Endolo ino, odimakani bosepa mooehole mokɛkɛ na bohu bo nde. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Endolo nadi na tati enɔi na bonɛnɛ bonɔ e Yoane, tengasa misala makɔkɔ mbi, oko mia mipakani Sesa bo namikokedje. Misala mimina mapaka tati tina e mbi bo Sesa alomakani. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Ko Sesa yona olomakani yo pongono apaka tati ta tina e mbi. Endolo, oiyokani kɔpi e nde ko oiyenɛni nongo boso bo nde, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />ko tobaneakeni mibalo mi nde temiyeyoe ta tei e bino, tine bo todimeni yona olomaka yo. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Okaikoeni bopele makomi tine bo okalɛdjeni bodiha na ndjea e mu bomɔ bo seko: enakobea edi makomi mamina mapaka tati tina e mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1, 45 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Enakobea, otapalakani bodua adi mbi bɛngi odiheni mohelo. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Tenahombe gala ikadonge adi bato. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Endolo nakodjebeni bopele: oditini na epaeli tina e Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Naduaka na kombe e Sange e mbi ko olonini boasɔnini; endolo ekadabo moto adoi na kombe e nde mɛnɛ, ino bomoasɔkɔ! <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Okapaleni seko ekumu ekadonge adi bato endolo tohombakeni ekumu ekadonge adi Ndjakomba. Moda ndani oboanini bodima? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Endolo pɛ bolɛdjɛni bo nopundakeni adi Sange e mbi. Te mbi, edi Mose moto opundabini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dit 31, 26-27.</char></note>, yo moto oisakano elɛndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Okadimeani mɛnɛ Mose, odimeakabinini pongono, tengasa yo akomaka ta tina e mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dit 18, 15.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Endolo edakabo ino todimeni imikoma yo, moda ndani obwanini bodimani mibalo mi mbi?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayakedji bato koto i tano</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14, 13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6, 30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9, 10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Ngɔngimina, Yesu akatisaka dɔngɔ ikina ibeke i ngando e Galilea ibeamaka pongono ibeke i Tibelia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kombe ye ekina e </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ibeke i ngando e Galilea </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Idaka ta ngando enɛnɛ e </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Tibelia </char><char style="fp" closed="false">(Endja pongono ta 6, 23.) Edaka ta dɔngɔ isatina e ibeke.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Emumu e bato bamokimanaka, tine bato baenɛkɛ bimbete bi bokamoa bikɔkɔ yo tine boheledja bato ba bipeko. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu aiweaka ta ikoli ko adaka ena na batingami ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Enakobea Pasika, tɛkɛ e bayuda, ebatamaka. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Ehole endjaka Yesu emumu e bato bodua adi yo. Ahɔdjɔkɔ Pilipo: «Abwani so bodiha mwɛmbɛ mo bosomba tine boyedja bato bi basusu djɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Abalaka bea bɛngi ameke Pilipo, tengasa adjebaka ehele meako mibwanaka na nde bokɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Pilipo amosɔmbedjaka: «Molehi nongo na palanga i bibende mikama mibae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pata e palanga </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 6, 37.</char></note>, lotabwanake bosomba mwɛmbɛ tine bopa moto na moto moekenge o boyaka.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Omɔti o batingami ba nde, Andele, mwange Simo piɛlɛ, abalaka na nde: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />«Edi ya na mwenga omɔti adi na miɛmbɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekomama ta polo ye: mapa makɔmɔ na mbuma i ɔlɔge. Olɔge edi mia ma batakeli, edi elenge lɔsɔ. </char></note> mitano na swi babae. Mibwani bokɔ ye na bato bi banɛnɛ?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 2 Bak 4, 42-44.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Na bea Yesu abalaka: «Dedjani bato basusu.» Polo emina edaka na ndjani inɛnɛ. Na bea bada bo basusu; badaka mbuti na bami koto itano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu atombaka mwɛmbɛ ko ngɔngɔ i bosakoa Ndjakomba, bakabaneaka bato ibadaka ena. Abapaka pongono swi, bokokana na posa edaka na bu. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ehole eyakabo ko bagolaka, Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Andoani bikenga kengi ibidiki, eka emɔti edae pɛ bobeha.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Babiandoaka ko balumedjaka mitinga domi na ibae na bikenga kengi ibidikaka ta miɛmbɛ mitano. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ehole enɛkɛ bato bimbete bi bokamoa bikɔkɔ Yesu, babalaka: «Moto iyo adi soti mɛnɛ Mbaeli o Ndjakomba yona obwani bodua ta ngondo!» <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu adjebaka malɛnɔ ma bobo bahombaka bamoimedje na bopipo Mokondji o bobo. Asatiedjaka naikina ta ikoli, yo mɛnɛ bɛngi adike yo mɛnɛ.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adali diko i madiba</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14, 22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mlk 6, 45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Ehole eimeaka mɔmɔkɔ, batingami ba Yesu batitaka ta mokula mo ibeke. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Batiteaka ta bwato bɛngi bakatise ibeke ta dɔngɔ i Kapalanauma. Bulu boimeaka ko Yesu aidaka na bu polo emɔti. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Madiba ma ibeke makumanaka mɛnɛ, tengasa lungu ekumbaka na bopipo. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Batingami balukaka mbuti na boyai bo kilomɛtɛlɛ itano kaoko isamano. Ehole enɛkɛ bo Yesu bobatama mbuti na bwato adale diko i madiba; ko baimeaka na bɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Endolo Yesu abalaka na bu: «Pɛ bobangani, edi oko mbi!» <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Batingami bapalaka bamotombe ta bwato, endolo na mbala emɔti bwato bosɛmɛkɛ o ngondo, ta polo ekɛkɛ bo.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emumu e bato ehombi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ngɔngɔ i isu imɔti, emumu e bato edikaka ta dongɔ ikina i mokula mo ibeke badjebaka boo oho bwato bodikaka oko bomɔti. Bato badjebaka bo Yesu aititeaka ta bwato engbanga na batingami ba nde, endolo batingami bakɛkɛ bo bɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Na bea, mato makina, madongaka ta ibeke i Tibelia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja 6, 1 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>, maimeaka mbuti na polo yena edaka bo bayaka mwɛmbɛ, ngɔngɔ i Kumu bosɔmbedja misakoa adi Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ehole enɛkɛ bato Yesu na batingami ba nde baidaka ena, batiteaka ta mato ko bakɛkɛ ta ngando enɛnɛ e Kapalanauma tine bomohomba.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mwɛmbɛ mo bomɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Bataneaka Yesu ta dɔngɔ ikina i ibeke ko babalaka na nde: «Labi, oimei iya ehole nda?» <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Okobea, nabali na nu: edi soti, wahombakanini tine oyakani ko ogolini; endolo editi tine boo osipoitini bimbete bi ngindola bikɔki mbi. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Pɛ bosalani tine mia i makapɔe, endolo tine mia i mayeyoake ko i madi na bomɔ bo seko; mia mamina, Mwana o Moto aopabini, tine boo edi yo Ndjakomba Sango, adimedja boisa adi yo embete e nde.» <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Na bea bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Ebwani na su bokɔ nde, bɛngi losale misala mambaka Ndjakomba boo losale?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Mosala mambaka na Ndjakomba adi no, edi odimeni yona oloma yo.» <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Babalaka na nde: «Embete e ngindola ebwani na wɛ boloinedja bɛngi lodime nda? Akɔke wɛ mɛnɛ nde? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Batata su bayaka mana ta etengelenge, elenge ebalaka ikomi: “Abayakedja mwɛmbɛ imodonga ta busa.”» <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Okobea, nabalaka na nu, edi soti: eidaka Mose moto obapa mwɛmbɛ imodonga ta busa, endolo edi Sange e mbi moto opani mwɛmbɛ mosoti mo busa. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Tengasa mwɛmbɛ mokapɛ Ndjakomba, edi yona otita ta busa tine bopa bomɔ adi bato ba ngondo.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Na bea babalaka na nde: «Kumu, lopa mwɛmbɛ momina.» <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Nadi mwɛmbɛ mo bomɔ. Yona aduake adi mbi atokabi nongo ndja ko yona odimeini aoketebi nongo posa e madiba.» <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Elenge abala mbi na nu: Oeninini endolo odimitinini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 20, 29.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Moto mosusu opani Sesa aduabi adi mbi ko mbi nadumbetebi nongo yona oduabi adi mbi. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Tengasa nadongaka ta busa te na bokɔ bolulea bo mbi, endolo bokɔ bolulea bo yona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Ko endjani bolulea bo yona olomani: edi boo nadae pɛ bobungedja nongo omɔti adi bato basusu ibapani yo, endolo nabasisodjebi ta isu i suka. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Soti, endja bolulea bokapale Sange e mbi: moto mosusu oeni Mwana ko amodimei, adiabi mohelo mo seko ko namosisodjabi ta isu i suka.<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Bayuda bakotoaka Yesu tine abalaka: «Nadi mwɛmbɛ modonga ta busa.» <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Babalaka: «Iyo te Yesu, Mwana o Esepu? Ladjebaka bopele Sange e nde na nange e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mal 6, 3; Mat 13, 55; Luk 4, 22.</char></note>. Moda ndani abalaka edɛdi boo adonga ta busa?» <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Kinani bosakotoani. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Moto abwaniti bodua adi mbi emitida bo Sange e mbi amitimoloma adi mbi; ibea mbi namosisodjake ta isu i suka. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba ba komaka: “Bato basusu balehamabi na Ndjakomba.” Yona oki Sesa bobala ko adimi eleho e nde, aduake adi mbi. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Etatingodjaka mɛnɛ moto aeni Sesa; tengasa edi oko yona odonga adi Ndjakomba aenɛkɛ Sesa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1, 18.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Okobea, nabalaka na nu, edi soti: yona odimi adi na mohelo mo seko. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Nadi mwɛmbɛ mo bomɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Batata nu bayaka soti mana, endolo nongo bea bagwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Endolo endja mwɛmbɛ mu imodonga ta busa, tine boo moto yona amoyake, agwɛtebi. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Nadi mwɛmbɛ mo bomɔ imodonga ta busa. Ekadabo moto akayaka mwɛmbɛ momina, adabi na mohelo tine seko. Mwɛmbɛ mo mopabi mbi bɛngi bato ba ngondo bahele, edi mokuku mo mbi.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Bayuda baimeaka bosoana ibo na ibo. Babalaka: «Moda ndani moto iyo adi bolopa mokuku mo nde bɛngi lomoyake?» <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Okobea, nabali na nu, edi soti: omiti yakani mokuku mo Mwana o Moto ko omiti mwakani makia ma nde, otadiakeni mohelo ta tei e bino. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Yona ayake mokuku mo mbi ko amwake makia ma mbi adi na mohelo mo seko ko na mosisodjabi ta busa bo suka. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Tengasa mokuku mo mbi modi mia mapele ko makia ma mbi madi elenge mana mapele. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Yona ayake mokuku mo mbi ko amwake makia ma mbi loimei omɔti: yo ta tei e mbi ko mbi ta tei e nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Elenge Sange e mbi yona olomani adi na bomɔ ko mbi nadi na bomɔ na ndjea e nde; oko moda momɔti yona ayakeni, adake na bomɔ na ndjea e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Endjani mwɛmbɛ imotita ta busa. Editi elenge mwɛmbɛ imoyaka ba sange i bino, ibia ibagwa. Endolo yona ayaka mwɛmbɛ imu, adabi na bomɔ bo seko.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu abalaka mibalo mimina ehole elehaka yo ta sinagoga ta ngando enɛnɛ e Kapalanauma.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mibalo mi bomɔ bo seko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ngɔngɔ ihokamedjakabo Yesu, banɛnɛ ta tei e batingami ba nde babalaka: «Bihelo bi binɔi na bopipo! Obwani bobidima nda?» <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu asipoaka boo batingami ba nde banungunaka na ilako imina, abalaka na bu: «Ilako imina lobenedjini? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ko mokaimea boo Mwana o Moto asɔmbi oho adonga yo, moadake bo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bik 1, 9-11.</char></note>? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Edi Mwembo mo Ndjakomba akapɛ bomɔ; mokuku mo mɛnɛ moditi na eka. Mibalo motɔndeini mbi midi Mwembo ko bomɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Endolo ta tei e bino bakina batadimaka». Na tina emina, Yesu adjebaka donga ehele boo bakina baimodimeaka ko yona amokabake. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Abalaka naikina: «Na tina emina nabali na nu moto abwaniti bodua adi mbi emiti da boo Sesa amopɛ enɔeli.»<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Donga ehole emina, banɛnɛ ta tei e batingami ba nde basasuaka ko balonaka bokɛ engbanga na nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Na bea Yesu ahɔdjɔkɔ batingami domi na babae ibadikaka: «Ino pongono opalini okɛni?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simo Piɛlɛ amosɔmbedjaka: «Kumu, lokɛ naikina adi nda? Wɛ odi na mobalo mokapɛ bomɔ bo seko. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Lodimi ko lodjebi boo wɛ odi Mosɛnɔke olomama na Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 16, 16; Mal 8, 29; Luk 9, 20.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Mbi moto ohɔni ino basusu domi na babae. Enakobea omɔti ta tei e bino adi djabulu!» <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Abalaka ta tina e Yudasi mwana o Simo Isikaliota. Tengasa Yudasi, omɔti o domi na babae, obongedjama amokababi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 71 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 13, 2, 21; 18, 5.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Bangi Yesu baimodimea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ngɔngɔ imina, Yesu adaka bodala ta ngando e Galilea, alonaka bokɛ ta ngando e Yuda, tengasa bakondji ba bayuda bahombaka bomowa. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Enakobea tɛkɛ e bayuda, yena ebeakabo tɛkɛ e bitondo, eimeaka mbuti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɛkɛ e bitondo edaka tɛkɛ e bayuda ekɔmɔkɔ pɔsɛ emɔti. Ebangaka bokɔmɔ mbuti na suka e songe o ibuwa ko esukeaka ta songe o domi. Bayuda badaka bokɔ tɛkɛ emina ta tei e bitondo. Badaka balɛdjɛ ehole edaka bakɔkɔ ba bobo bahela ta bitondo ehole adalaka bo ta etengelenge. Endja pongono ta Lew 23, 34-36; Dut 16, 13-15. </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Bange i Yesu babalaka na nde: «Donga ya ko kɛ ta ngando e Yuda, bɛngi boo batingami ba wɛ, ibo pongono, baenɛ misala makɔkɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Pɛ moto okakɔe ta mbombi akada na posa adjebame. Elenge akɔkɔ wɛ bimbete moda na moda, kɔɔ bo bato basusu ba ngondo baenɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Na bea, edɛ bange i nde baimodimeaka. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Ehole e mbi eimeakini. Endolo ino odini seko na bihole. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Ngondo eboaniti bolonani, endolo edi na swɛ na mbi; tine boo mbi nakainedje mikɔ mi yu midi mibe. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Ino, kɛni ta tɛkɛ emina; endolo mbi nitakɛkɛ oho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Natakɛkɛ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Nakoma makina madi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Natakɛkɛ naikina.</char></note>, tine ehole e mbi epakini akokedjama.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ngɔngɔ i bobala bea, adikaka ta ngando e Galilea.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta tɛkɛ e bitondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ehole ekɛkɛ bange i nde ta tɛkɛ, Yesu pongono akɛkɛ; adaka bosabomba, aipalaka bosenɛmedja na bato. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Bakondji ba bayuda bamohombaka ta ehole e tɛkɛ emina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 7, 2 ko molɔngɔ.</char></note> ko bahɔdjɔkɔ: «Adi yo djɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Emumu e bato babalaka bobuke ta tina e nde. Bamɔti babalaka: «Adi moto mopele.» Endolo bakina babalaka: «Ngasa, abungedji bato.» <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Endolo pɛ moto obalaka na nde ta bhuda, tine boo bato basusu badaka na bɔɔ na bakondji ba bayuda. <verse eid="JHN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ehole eimeaka tɛkɛ ta ndanda, Yesu akweaka ta tepelo ko abangaka boleha. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Bayuda badaka bokamoa ko bobala: «Moda ndani moto yo asipoaka makomi, iyo oda pɛ boikoa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 13, 54; Luk 2, 47.</char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Bileho bopakani mbi bidongiti adi mbi, endolo adi Ndjakomba yona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Yona odimi bokɔ bopala bo Ndjakomba, adjebake soti bileho bi mbi bidongi adi Ndjakomba kaoko nabalaka ta tina e kombe e mbi mɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Moto okabale ta tina e kombe e nde mɛnɛ, bohombaka ekumu e nde mɛnɛ. Endolo yona okahombe ekumu e yona omoloma, abalaka soti ko bobe boditi ta tei e nde. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Mose aopakani mobeko, editi bea? Endolo pɛ omɔti o bino atamoisaka ta mosala. Tina ahombakano bowani nda?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Emumu e bato bamosɔmbedjaka: «Wɛ odi na mwembo mobe! Ohombaka aowoe nda?» <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Nakɔi oko mosala momɔti ko endjani oimeini ino basusu bokamoa! <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Tine boo Mose aopani mobeko mo bolena songɔ i bami, eidaka Mose moto obangaka bokɔ, endolo ebangaka na ba kɔkɔ ba biso ba boso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edja ta Lew 12, 3; Mba 17, 10-13.</char></note>, na bea ino odimakani bolenedja bami songɔ nongo ta busa bo sabata. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Ekada bo obwanini bolenedja songɔ i bami ta busa bo sabata tine boo mobeko mo Mose modae mosumamake; ko tina ndani oimeini na kɛlɛ na mbi, tine boo naheledji moto ta busa bo sabata? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Kinani bosambedja na moda moenɛkɛno na miso. Sambedjani na bodjo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 19, 15; Isa 11, 4.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adi Kilito?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Bato bakina ba ngando e Yelusalɛmɛ baimeaka bobala: «Editi moto yo ahombaka bo bowoe? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Endja: abalaka ta bhuda ko batamobaleaka nongo eka! Na bea, bakondji ba biso badimiti soti mɛnɛ boo adi Kilito? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Endolo ehole enɛmɛbi Kilito, pɛ moto odjebabi dɔngɔ ladongakake yo; enakobea tina e moto omina, ladjebaka dɔngɔ idonga yo!» <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Na bea Yesu alehaka ta tepelo; agamaka: «Ino bɛnɛ odjebakanini? Odjebakani dɔngɔ i donga mbi? Naidua na mbi mɛnɛ, endolo yona olomani adi soti. Ino otamodjebakani. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Mbi, nakamodjebe, tine boo nadongake adi yo ko edi yo moto olomani.» <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Na bea bahombaka bamope, endolo pɛ moto obakea ebɔ diko i nde, tengasa ehole e nde eipaka imea. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Na bea ta emumu e bato, banɛnɛ bamodimeaka. Babalaka: «Ehole eduabi Kilito, akɔbi bimbete binɛnɛ bi bokamoa bida pɛ bokɔmɔ na moto iyo?»<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babanɛi balomami tine bopea Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Manungunungu ma emumu e bato ta tina e Yesu maokamaka ta matoi ma bapalusai. Na bea bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na bapalusai balomaka babanei bɛngi bamopee. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu abalaka: «Nadi na nu naikina mooehole mokɛkɛ, ngɔngɔ nakɛke adi yona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Wahombakenini, endolo otaenɛkɛnini; tengasa otabwanakeni bokɛ oho adake mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Bayuda basahɔdjɔkɔ: «Akɛke yo djɔ bɛngi lodae pɛ bomodia? Lalɛdjɛkɛ boo abwani bokɛ adi bayuda ibanangana ta tei e bagɛlɛki ko bobalwɛ bileho bi nde oho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekabee bo </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Gɛlɛki </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Etingodji iya bo bato badi pɛ boda bayuda edaka nde bayuda ibahelamaka sokolu e palesitine.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Mibalo mabalaka yo: “Wahombakenini, endolo otaenɛkɛnini; tengasa otabwanakeni bokɛ oho adake mbi.”» Atingodjakamo nde?<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duwa i madiba ma bomɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Ta busa bosuka bo tɛkɛ, edaka busa bonɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta lew 23, 36.</char></note>. Busa bo mina, Yesu, aema ko agamaka: «Moto akoka posa e madiba, adue adi mbi, amwake. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Elenge ebala makomi: “Yona odimeini, duwa i madiba ma bomɔ ikɛlɛbi ta tei e molema mo nde.”» <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu abalaka tina e Mwembo mo Ndjakomba ibia bamodimeake badi bodia ngɔngɔ i masu. Tengasa ehole emina, Mwembo mo Ndjakomba moipaka apama, tine boo Yesu aipaka angɔdjɔmɔ ta ekumu e nde.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emumu e bato esakabana tina e Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Ngɔngɔ i boka mibalo mimina, bamɔti ta tei emumu e bato babalaka: «Moto iyo adi soti mɛnɛ Mbaeli o Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bakina babalaka: «Adi Kilito!» Endolo, bakina pongono basɔmbedjaka: «Kilito abwani boima ta ngando e Galilea?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1, 46; 7, 52.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Na bea makomi ma balaka boo Kilito adabi motitani ta ibota i Dapiti ko aimabi ta ngando e Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, oho ta ngando edaka Dapiti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 2 Sam 7, 12; Mik 5, 1; Mat 2, 5.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Na bea bato basakabanaka tina e Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bakina ta tei e bobo badaka posa boo bamopee, endolo pɛ moto omopeaka.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taka e bodima e bakondji ba bayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Babanei basɔmbɔkɔ adi bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na bapalusai. Na bea bahɔdjɔkɔ babanei: «Odoitini na Yesu tina nda?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Babanei basɔmbedjaka: «Ngasa, pɛ moto okabale elenge yo!» <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Bapalusai ba bahɔdjɔkɔ: «Ino pongono, aokoseini? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Edi nongo na mokondji omɔti kaoko mopalusai omɔti amodimei? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Edi oko bato ibaka dae pɛ bodjeba mobeko mo Mose, ibalakedjama bobe!» <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodɛmɛ adaka omɔti o bapalusai odaka ena: edaka yo moto okɛkɛ bosakana na Yesu mooehole onɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 3, 1-2.</char></note>. Abalaka na bu: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />«Bokimana mobeko mo biso, loboaniti bodumba moto napɛ bomosambedja boso ko napɛ bodjeba modjɔ mokɔi yo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dit 1, 16.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Wɛ pongono, obwaniti boda moto o ngando e Galilea? Kokoledja makomi bopele ko wenɛke pɛ nongo mbaeli o Ndjakomba oimana ta ngando Galilea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1, 46; 7, 41.</char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 7:52">Mwali o ndukeli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:52">[<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Ngɔngɔ imina, moto na moto ayanaka ta ndako e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mo 7, 53-8.11 moditi ta makoma makina ma you ko ta minɔkɔ mi latine, silake, na mikina. Baa makomi makina mabalaka boso, na bomatanea oko ta suka e bwɛndji bopele.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Endolo Yesu akɛkɛ ta ikoli i Olipa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mal 11, 1 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Ehuma mɛnɛ e pumasɛnɛ, asɔmbɔkɔ ta tepelo ko bato basusu baduaka adi yo. Adaka ko abangaka bobaleha. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Na bea balehi ba mobeko ko bapalusai baduaka na mwali omɔti opeaka bo na ndukeli. Bamoemeaka ta boso bo bato basusu <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />ko babalaka na Yesu: «Molehi, mwali yo lomopei oko ta ehole edaki yo akɔ bɔɔli. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mose alopaka ta mobeko bowa bali modumba mu na mabanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 20, 10; Dit 22, 22-24.</char></note>. Ko wɛ, obali bo?» <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Babalaka bea bɛngi bamopikee elambo, tine bohomba modjɔ mo bomopunda. Endolo Yesu angundamaka ko abangaka, na ndjea e mosapi mo nde, aimeaka bokoma ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Elenge adaka bo oko bamɔhɔdjɔ mahɔdjɔ, Yesu asunoaka ko abalaka na bu: «Ta tei e bino odjebi boo aditi na bobe amolɛ ibanga boso.»<verse eid="JHN 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Na bea angundamaka naikina, ko na ndjea e mosapi mo nde, abangaka bokoma ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Ehole eoka bo mibalo mimina, bakɛ omɔti ngɔngɔ i okina, bobanga na ibadaka basuku. Yesu adika oko yo mɛnɛ na mwali omina, aemi ta boso bo nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Na bea Yesu asunoaka ko abalaka na nde: «Bato bamina badoo? Pɛ moto olenei etumbo?» <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Amosɔmbedjaka: «Kumu, pɛ moto.» Yesu abalaka na nde: «Mbi pongono nodumbiti na modjɔ. Obwani bokɛ, endolo pɛ bokɔ bobe naikina.»]<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bohu bo ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu abalaka naikina na bato: «Nadi bohu bo ngondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 49, 6; Mat 5, 140; Yoa 9, 5.</char></note>. Yona akimanakeni adiake buhu bo mohelo ko adaletebi naikina ta modidi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Bapalusai babalaka na nde: «Wasapaka tati e wɛ mɛnɛ; tati e wɛ editi e soti.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Nongo nakasapa tati tina e mbi mɛnɛ, tati e mbi edi e soti, tine boo nadjebaka dɔngɔ idonga mbi ko ikɛke mbi. Endolo ino, otadjebakani nongo dɔngɔ idonga mbi ko ikɛke mbi. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Okasambedjeni na moda mo bato; endolo mbi tenasambedjake moto. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Na bea, ekimea boo nasambedje, sambi e mbi edi e soti, tine boo naditi mbi mɛnɛ tine bosambedja, endolo nadi engbanga na Sesa yona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Ekomama ta mobeko mo bino, bato babae bakapa tati mondumba momɔti, tati emina edi soti. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Mbi nasapaka tati e mbi mɛnɛ ko Sesa yona olomani, akapɛ pongono tati tina e mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Sange e wɛ adi djɔ?» Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Ino todjebeni nongo mbi nongo Sesa. Ekada bo odjebinini, okɔkidjebani pongono Sange e mbi.»<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu abalaka mibalo mi ehole edaka yo eleha ta tepelo, ta polo edaka sanga i bipeli. Pɛ moto omopea, tine boo ehole e nde eipakaimea.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alomami na Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu abalaka na bu naikina: «Mbi nakɛke; endolo wahombakenini ko wagwakeni ta bobe bo bino. Obwanitini bokɛ ta dɔngɔ lakɛke mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Bayuda basabaleaka: «Akɛi asowa, bɛngi abale: “Obwanitini bokɛ ta dɔngɔ lakɛke mbi?”» <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Odini bato ba ngondo, endolo mbi nadongi ta busa. Odini bato ba ngondo ye, endolo mbi naditi moto o ngondo ye. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Na tina emina nabalaka na nu wagwakeni ta mabe ma bino. Tengasa wagwakeni ta ma mabe ma bino omitidimani “mbi nadi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 3, 14-15.</char></note>”» <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Wɛ nda?» Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Edi yona otɔndeani mbi donga ta mbangi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yena... Ta mbangi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bobanga, tina ndani ino wa baleyakinini? </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kaoko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Oko eka ebalaka mbi.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Nadi na midjɔ minɛnɛ mi bobala ko mi bosambedja ta tina e bino. Endolo nakatɔndee bato oko imikoa mbi na yona olomani; ko yo, akabale soti.» <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Baisipoaka boo abalaka tina e Sange e nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yesu abalaka na bu naikina: «Ehole angɔdjɔkeno Mwana o Moto, wadjebakeni boo “mbi nadi”; ko tenakɔe meako na mbi mɛnɛ: nakabale oko bokimana moda imolehani Sange e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Iyona olomani adi na mbi engbanga; ko takineni mbi mɛnɛ, tine boo nakakɔe seko meako mikamosepedje.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Elenge abalaka Yesu bea, bato banɛnɛ bamodimeaka.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basɔmi na babuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bayuda ibia bamodimeaka: «Okadimani mibalo mi mbi, odini soti mɛnɛ batingami ba mbi. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Na bea wadjebakeni soti ko soti eimedjakeni basɔmi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Iso lodi batitani ba Abalayama ko loida nongo babuli ba bato. Moda ndani obwani bobala: “Wimeakeni basɔmi?”» <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Okobea nabali na nu, edi soti: moto mosusu akɔkɔ bobe adi mobuli o bobe. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mobuli tadae seko moto o ibota, endolo mwana momi bodikaka tine seko ta ibota. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ekadabo Mwana akoimedjani basɔmi, na bea wadakeni mɛnɛ basɔmi. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Nadjebaka boo odini batitani ba Abalayama. Endolo wahombakani bowanini, tine boo walonakani bodima mibalo mi mbi. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Mbi, nabalaka iminedjani sange e mbi, endolo ino, wakɔkɔni imolakani sange e bino.» <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Sange e biso, edi Abalayama.» Yesu abalaka na bu: «Akɔkino dani bana ba Abalayama, obwanakini bokɔ meako imikɔ yo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okadani mɛnɛ... </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Obwanakini </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina maa </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Akɔkino da... Bokɔ... </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Meyako mikɔkɔ yo </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Bae 11, 8-19.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Endolo edɛdi, nongo nobaleini soti yena eikoa mbi adi Ndjakomba, wahombakani bowani. Enakobea Abalayama aikɔ bea. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Ino, wakɔkɔni meako oko moda momɔti na sange e bino.» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Iso loditi bana ba misamba. Lodi oko na Sange e biso omɔti, Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Ekadabo Ndjakomba adaka Sange e bino, okɔkini palanini; tengasa nadonga adi Ndjakomba ko nadi ya tina e nde. Naidua na bopala bo mbi mɛnɛ, endolo yo moto olomakani. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Tina ndani otasipoakani mibalo mabalaka mbi na nu? Tine boo oditini na makoki ma bodima mibalo mi mbi. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Sange e bino edi djabulu ko wapalakani bokɔ posa e sange e bino. Adaka mowoi donga ta mbangi. Pɛ nongo mbala emɔti ebala yo soti tine bosoti editi ta tei e nde. Ehole ekabale yo meako mi boloa, akabale moda mokadae yo, tine boo adi mokosi ko sange e boloa. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Endolo mbi nakabale soti ko na tina emina todimeakenini. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ta ndanda e bino, moto omɔti abwani boinedja nongo bobe bo mbi bomɔti? Ko ekada boo nabalaka soti, tina ndani otadimeakanini? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Iyona odi o Ndjakomba, bokaka mibalo mi Ndjakomba. Endolo ino oditini bato ba Ndjakomba, na tina emina otaokeakanini.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Abalayama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Bayuda basɔmbedjaka Yesu: «Soti lodi na elonga e bobala boo odi mosamalia ko odi na mwembo mobe!» <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Ngasa, naditi na mwembo mobe! Endolo nakumeaka Sange e mbi ko ino, wenɛkɛnini moto ngasa. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Natahombaka ekumu tina e mbi mɛnɛ. Edi na omɔti ahombaka ekumu tina e mbi ko yo bosambedjaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Okobea, nabalaka na nu, edi soti: Iyona osumaka mibalo mi mbi agwɛtebi.»<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Bayuda babalaka na nde: «Edɛdi lodimi mɛnɛ boo odi na mwembo mobe! Abalayama agwa, ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba pongono bagwa, na bea wɛ obali: “Iyona asumaka mibalo mi mbi agwɛtebi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Walɛdjɛkɛ boo onɔi sange e biso Abalayama yona ogwa na ekumu? Ba mbaeli ba Ndjakomba pongono bagwa! Wasenɛkɛ elenge nda?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Ekadabo nasakumeaka mbi mɛnɛ, ekumu emina editi na tina. Yona wakumedjakani, edi Sange e mbi. Wabalakani na tina e nde: “Adi Ndjakomba o biso”, <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />enakobea tomodjebakeni. Endolo mbi nakamodje. Ekadabo nabali tenamodjebe, ena nadi mokosi elenge no. Endolo mbi nakamodjebe ko nakasume mibalo mi nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Abalayama, sange e bino, alumedjamaka nasepi na malɛi maboenɛ busa bo mbi; aboenɛkɛ ko alumaka nasepi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Bayuda babalaka na nde: «Wɛ oimeakini nongo bianga tuku itano ko obali bo oenɛ Abalayama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 57 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oenɛ Abalayama? </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina maa </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Abalayama omoenɛ?</char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Okobea, nabali na nu, edi soti: boso bo Abalayama abotame, “Mbi nadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1, 1-3.</char></note>”.» <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Ngɔngɔ i boka bea, bandoaka mabanga bɛngi bamolɛ. Endolo Yesu asabombaka ko asomɔnedja na bu ta ikanga i tepelo.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto obotama miso mago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Ta bonɔ bo nde, aenɛkɛ moto omɔti ogwa miso donga bobotama bo nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Batingami ba nde bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Labi, tina ndani moto yo abotama miso mago: edi tine bobe bo nde kaoko tine bobe bo baboti ba nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 20, 5.</char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Ngasa, editi nongo ta tine e bobe bo nde, kaoko tine e bobe bo baboti ba nde. Adi miso mago tine boo misala mi Ndjakomba mienɛme adi yo. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Ehole edi moi, lobwani bokokedja misala mi yona ololomaka. Bulu bobatami, moto abwaniti bosala. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ehole edi mbi ta ngondo, nadi bohu bo ngondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 8, 12 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ngɔngɔ i bobala mibalo mimina, Yesu atsuwɛaka masɔi ta kpɔtɔ ko anyɔmɔkɔ kpɔtɔ imina na masɔi ma nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mal 8, 23.</char></note>; asuoaka ta miso ma moto ogwa miso. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Abalaka na nde: «Kɛ asose boso ta esoseli e Silowe.» Kombe emina etingondjaka «Elomu». Moto o miso mago akɛkɛ, asosaka boso ko ehole ehulaka yo, aenɛkɛ! <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Batuteani ba nde ko na bia bamoenɛkɛ adaka asɛngɛ boso bahɔdjɔkɔ: «Iyo te moto odaki na mobondo tine bosɛngɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bamɔti babalaka: «Edi oko yo.» Bakina babalaka: «Ngasa, editi yo, endolo akuwanaka na nde.» Enakobea yo mɛnɛ abalaka: «Edi soti oko mbi!» <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Moda ndani miso ma wɛ maheli?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Asɔmbedjaka: «Moto okabe bo Yesu anyɔmi moo kpɔtɔ na masɔi ma nde, amosuoini ta miso ko abali na mbi: “Kɛ ta esoseli e Silowe sosa boso.” Na bea nakɛkɛ, nasosa boso ngɔngɔ naenɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Adi moto omina djɔ?» Abasɔmbedjaka: «Natadjeba.»<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapalusai basambedji moto ogwa miso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Na bea bakɛkɛ adi bapalusai na moto odaka na miso mago. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Enakobea, Yesu anyɔmɔkɔ kpɔtɔ ko aheledjaka moto o miso mago ta busa bo sabata. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Na tina emina bapalusai, ibo pongono, bahɔdjɔkɔ moto omina meako iminɔmɔkɔ bɛngi boo oenɛ edɛdi. Abalaka na bu: «Asingini baasɛtɛ ba kpɔtɔ inyɔmɔkɔ yo ta miso, nasosi boso ko edɛdi naeni.» <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Ekenge e bapalusai babalaka: «Moto yo adongiti adi Ndjakomba, tengasa tasumake busa bo sabata.» Endolo bakina basɔmbedjaka: «Moda ndani moto mobe abwani bokɔ bimbete bi ngindola moda mu?» Ko basakabanaka. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Bapalusai bahɔdjɔkɔ naikina moto ohela miso: «Ko wɛ, e bali wɛ tine moto oheledji miso nde?» Yo abasɔmbedjaka: «Adi mbaeli o Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Enakobea, bakondji ba bayuda baidimaka boo adaka na miso mago ko edɛdi aheli. Na tina emina babeaka baboti ba nde <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />bɛngi babahɔdje. Babalaka na bu: «Adi soti mɛnɛ mwana o bino? Abotamaka soti miso mago? Ekɔmi edɛdi nde bɛngi aenɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Baboti ba nde basɔmbedjaka: «Lodjebi boo adi mwana o biso ko abotama miso mago. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Endolo lotadjebaka meako misanɔmɔ boo aenɛ edɛdi ko lotadjebaka mɛnɛ moto oheledji miso ma nde. Mohɔdjɔni yo mɛnɛ, adi bosuku abwani bosɔmbedja yo mɛnɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Babalaka bea tine badaka na bɔɔ bo bakondji ba bayuda. Na bea, badimanaka bobudjea moto mosusu ta sinagoga odimakabi boo Yesu adi Kilito. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Na tina emina baboti ba nde babalaka: «Mohɔdjɔni yo mɛnɛ, adi bosuku abwani bosɔmbedja yo mɛnɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Bapalusai babeaka mbala e babae moto odaka miso mago ko babalaka na nde: «Bala soti ta boso bo Ndjakomba! Ladjebaka boo moto yo adi moto mobe.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Abasɔmbedjaka: «Mbi nitadjeba too adi moto mobe kaoko ngasa! Endolo nadjebi oko eka emɔti: Nadaki miso mago ko edɛdi naeni.» <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Bamohɔdjɔkɔ naikina: «Eokɔi yo nde? Aheledji miso ma wɛ moda nda?» <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Abasɔmbedjaka: «Notɔndeakini ehele, endolo okeitinini. Nabale naikina bo? Ehole ekina ino wapalakani boimea pongono batingami ba nde?» <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Bamosingaka ko babalaka na nde: «Wɛ moto odi motingami o nde! Iso lodi batingami ba Mose. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Ladjebaka Ndjakomba abalaka na Mose; endolo yo, lotadjebaka dɔngɔ i dongi yo!» <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Moto omina asɔmbedjaka: «Endja modjɔ mo bokamoa: otadjebakani dɔngɔ i dongi yo, enakobea adipoi miso ma mbi! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Ladjebaka boo Ndjakomba tasɔmbedje bato babe, endolo Ndjakomba akasɔmbedje moto mosusu okamosume ko okakɔe bolulea bo nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 1, 15; Ndj 34, 16; 66, 18; Mas 15, 29.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Lokakini bobala isolo i moto aheledji moto o miso mago donga ehele ta botama bo nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Esedabo moto omina adonga adi Ndjakomba, abwaniti akɔe bea.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Wɛ obotama bosusu ta bobe ko wapalaka ololake?» Ko bamobenganaka sokolu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bamobengaka ta sinagoga </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bamoimedjaka sokolu e ngando.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taka e ndjɛnɛ e Mwembo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Ehole eokaka Yesu boo babenganaka moto omina, asakanaka na nde ko amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Okadime Mwana o Moto?» <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Asɔmbedjaka: «Kumu, tɔndeani adi nda, bɛngi na modime!» <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Wamoenɛkɛ, yona obali na wɛ edɛdi.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Na bea moto omina abalaka: «Kumu, nadimi!» Ko akwaka magbundɔ ta boso bo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Na bea Yesu abalaka: «Nadoi ta ngondo ye tine botikoanedja bokɔɔme: tine boo bato ibagwa miso baenɛ ko ibia baenɛkɛ baime bato ba miso mago.» <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Ekenge e bapalusai ibadaka mbuti na nde baokaka mibalo mimina ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Wapalaka bobala boo iso lodi bato bagwa miso?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Akɔki no dani bato ibagwa miso, okɔkitini daani na lindo. Endolo elenge abali no: “Loenɛkɛ,” e bali boo odikini na lindo e bino.»<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mobanei o bhata ko bhata ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu abalaka: «Okobea, nabali na nu, edi soti: moto yona adake pɛ bokwea ta ekukɛ e ikutu i bhata, endolo akwei ta polo ekina, moto omina adi moibi ko mobedji. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Endolo yona okakwee ta ekukɛ adi mobanei o bhata. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mobanei akadipoe ekukɛ e ikutu ko bhata ikoke moholi mo nde. Akabe bhata ba nde na kombe ko akakɛ na yu sokolu. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ehole ebaimedji yo basusu sokolu, akadale boso bo yu ko bhata ikamokimane, tine boo ikadjebe moholi mo nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Endolo ibwaniti bokimana moto okina; enakobea ibwani botia bohali moto okina omina, tine boo teidjebake moholi mo nde.»<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu abatɔndeaka isɛ dia, endolo bato ibamohokamedjaka baisipoaka meako mipalaka yo bobala.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mobanei mopele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yesu abalaka naikina: «Okobea, nabali na nu: edi soti: Mbi nadi ekukɛ e bhata. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Bato basusu ibaduaka boso bo mbi, badi baubi ko babedji; endolo bhata baibokaka. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Mbi nadi ekukɛ. Iyona onɔbi na ndjea e mbi, ahelabi; abwani bokwea ko boima, adiabi mia. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Moibi akadue oko tine boiba, bowa ko bobedja. Mbi, nadoi tine bato badihe bomɔ ko na bonɔke. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Mbi nadi mobanei mopele o bhata. Mobanei mopele o bhata akapɛ mohelo mo nde tine bhata ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Mobanei okasale oko tine palanga, aditi moswa bhata. Akasundole bhata ko akatie ehole eni yo swa; na bea swa esasabi diko i bhata ko enanganedji bwela bomina. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Endja meako mikakɔme tina e moto okasale oko tine palanga ko aditi na ndjokwa na bhata. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Mbi nadi mobanei mopele. Nakadjebe bhata ba mbi ko bhata ba mbi bakadjebeni pongono <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />oko elenge Sesa akadjebeni, mbi pongono nakamodjebe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 11, 27; Luk 10, 22.</char></note>. Nakapɛ bomɔ bo mbi tine bhata ba mbi. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Nadi pongono na bhata bakina baditi ba ikutu idi. Natungi pongono bobadaledja; baokakabi moholi mo mbi ko baimeabi bwela bomɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baimeakabi bwela bomɔti </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina mabali </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Baimeakabi etonga emɔti.</char></note> na mobanei omɔti. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Sange e mbi akapaleni tine nakapɛ mohelo mo mbi, tine na mobolodjabi naikina. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Moto abwaniti bokatoani mohelo; endolo nakamopɛ na bopala bo mbi mɛnɛ. Nadi na kpatsi e bomopa ko bomodia naikina. Yena ebwani na mobeko mopani Sesa.» <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Bayuda basakabanaka naikina tina e mobalo momina. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Banɛnɛ ta tei e bobo babalaka: «Moto yo adi na mwembo mobe! Adi na pupulɔ! Tina ndani wamohokamedjakani?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Bakina babalaka: «Moto o mwembo mobe aboaniti boimedja mibalo mi! Mwembo mobe aboani boheledja bato i bagwa miso?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alonami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Edaka ta ehole e piyɔ ko basepaka tɛkɛ e bodjongoa tepelo ta Yelusalɛmɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɛkɛ e bondjongowa bo tepelo e Yelusalɛmɛ.</char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ekakɔme ta Yelusalɛmɛ mbuti na suka e songe o domi na babae, tine bosisodja malɛno ma bobɔngedja ko bondjongowa bobuki bo esika etumbaka bo mbeka ta tepelo. Ekɔmɔkɔ na bopala bo Yudasi Makabe.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu adaka boeteta ta tepelo, na se e mbalasani e Salomo. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Na bea Bayuda baputoanaka mbuti na nde ko babalaka: «Mbunoko ehole ndani walokinaka milema minanganake? Okada Kilito, lobalea bohu!» <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Nobaleini ehele, endolo otadimakani. Misala makɔkɔ mbi ta kombe e Sange e mbi mapaka tati tina e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Endolo otadimakani, tine boo oditini ta bwela bo bhata ba mbi. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Bhata ba mbi bakoke moholi mo mbi; nakabadjebe ko ibo bakakimaneni. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Nabapa mohelo mo seko na seko, babungetebi nongo ko moto abakatoetebi ta ebɔ e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Yena epani Sesa, enɔi losusu na bonɛnɛ ko pɛ moto obwani boekatoani ta ebɔ e Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Mbi na Sesa, lodi omɔti.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Bayuda bandoaka naikina mabanga bɛngi bamolɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 8, 59.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Noinedjini misala minɛnɛ mipele na ngulu e Sange e mbi. Na bea wapalakani bowanini na mabanga tina e misala mimina?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Bayuda bamosɔmbedjaka: «Lotapalaka bowa na mabanga tine mosala mopele, endolo tine wasingaka Ndjakomba: odi oko moto endolo wapalaka bosimedja Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Ekomama ta mobeko mo bino: Ndjakomba abali: “Odini ba ndjakomba.” <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Lodjebi bo lobwaniti bodongedja eka edimami ta ikomi. Enakobea, Ndjakomba abalaka na bato ko aimeaka bobabea ba ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Na bea Sange e mbi ahɔni ko alomani ta ngondo. Tina ndani wabalakani boo nasingaka Ndjakomba tine nabali nadi Mwana o Ndjakomba? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Namitikɔ misala mi Sange e mbi, pɛ bodimeanini! <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Endolo nakamikɔ, nongo okalonani bodimeani; dimeanini nongo na misala mimina, bɛngi odjebeni ko osipoeni boo Sesa adi na mbi ko mbi nadi Sesa.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Bahombaka naikina ndjea e bomopea, endolo asomɔnodja na bu. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu akɛkɛ naikina ta dɔngɔ i duwa, e Yolodane ta polo ebangaka Yoane boina boso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1, 28.</char></note>, ko yo adikaka. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Emumu e bato baduaka adi yo. Babalaka: « Yoane aikɔ nongo embete emɔti e bokamoa, endolo meako misusu mibalaka yo tina e moto omina midaka soti.» <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Na bea, bato banɛnɛ badimeaka Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Bogwa bo Ladjalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Moto omɔti na kombe e Ladjalo apekaka. Adaka moto o ngando e Betania, ngando edaka Malia ngɛnɛ e nde mwali na Malata. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Malia adaka mwali yona osopeaka Kumu mosoloa moso e itindi ta mako ko ahakoaka na swe i nde. Adaka pongono ngɛnɛ e Ladjalo yona opekaka. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Bangɛnɛ ba Ladjalo balomaka moto akatɔndea Yesu: «Kumu, mopalani o wɛ adi na epeko.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Ehole eokaka Yesu gala emina, abalaka: «Epeko e Ladjalo etamolomake ta bogwa; edi bɛngi einedje ekumu e Ndjakomba ko ta boinedja pongono ekumu e Mwana o Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu apalaka Malata ko ngɛnɛ e nde Malia, na pongono Ladjalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ehole eokaka yo Ladjalo apeka, ayeyoaka naikina masu mabae ta polo edaka yo. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Ngɔngɔ abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Losɔmbeni ta ngando e Yuda.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Batingami bamosɔmbedjaka: «Labi, ekɔiti baasu bakondji ba bayuda bahombaki bowoe na mabanga ko wapalaka osɔmbe naikina oho?» <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Busa bomɔti bodi na ngonga domi na ibae, editi bea? Ekada moto adali na moi, atakwa, tine boo aenɛkɛ bohu bo ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Endolo moto akadala na bulu, abwani bokwa tine boo bohu boditi adi yo.» <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ngɔngɔ i bobala bea, Yesu abalaka naikina: «Mopalani o biso Ladjalo ahwɛli, endolo nakɛi amosisodja.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Batingami basɔmbedjaka: «Kumu, ahwɛli, ahelake.» <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Ta soti Yesu abalaka tine bogwa bo Ladjalo, enakobea batingami balɛdjɛkɛ boo Yesu abalaka tine hiyɔ ikahwɛe so. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yesu abalaka na bu bohu: «Ladjalo agwi. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Nadi nasepi tine nadakiti oho, bɛngi odimenini. Endolo lokɛni adi yo.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Na bea Toma obeakabo ipasa abalaka na batingami bakina: «Lokɛni, lokagwa na nde engbanga!»<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu adi bopusoa ko bomɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ehole eimeaka Yesu, aokaka boo bapusei Ladjalo ko akɔi masu manɛi ta ikila. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Ngando e Betania edaka mbuti na Yelusalɛmɛ, bohali bo kilomɛtɛlɛ mbuti na isato, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />ko bayuda banɛnɛ baduaka adi Malata na Malia tine bobagɔmbedja milema ta tina e bogwa bo mwange e bobo. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Ehole eokaka Malata boo Yesu adalake, akɛkɛ bosakana na nde; enakobea Malia adikaka ta ndako. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Malata abalaka na Yesu: «Kumu, osoda ya, ka ngɛnɛ mbi agwiti. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Endolo nadjebi edɛdi mɛnɛ boo Ndjakomba aopake losusu lahɔdjɔke wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Mwange e wɛ asisoake ta bogwa.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Malata asɔmbedjaka: «Nadjebaka boo asisoabi ehole esisoabi bago ta isu i suka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dan 12, 2.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu abalaka na nde naikina: «Mbi nadi bopusoa ko bɔmɔ. Moto yona odimeakeni adake na mohelo, nongo akagwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Na bea moto yona odi mɔ ko akadimeani, agwɛtebi. Odimi bea?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Asɔmbedjaka: «Okobea, Kumu, nadimi boo odi Kilito Mwana o Ndjakomba, yona odaka bodua ta ngondo.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ayei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ngɔngɔ i bobala bea, akɛkɛ. Na bea abeaka Malia ngɛnɛ e nde ko abalaka na nde na popoli: «Molehi adi ya ko aobeaka.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Aoka Malia bea, angɔ pɛpɛlɛ ko akɛ adi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Enakobea, Yesu aipakakwea ta ngando, endolo edaka oko ta polo esakanaka yo na Malata. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Ehole edaka bayuda na Malia ta ndako tine bomogɔmbedja, bamoenɛkɛ angɔi ko aimaka pɛpɛlɛ, bamokimanaka; tengasa balɛdjɛkɛ boo akɛi ta ikila tine boeya. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Malia aimeaka ta polo edaka Yesu; ehole enɛkɛ yo Yesu, akwaka ta mako ma nde ko abalaka na nde: «Kumu, osoda ya, ka ngɛnɛ e mbi agwiti.» <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Ehole emoenɛkɛ Yesu boeya, engbanga na bayuda bia ibadaka na nde, Yesu aimeaka na ndjokwa ko asatungeaka ta molema, <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />ko abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Amopuseino djɔ?» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Kumu, duwa aendje.» <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu aeya. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Na bea bayuda babalaka: «Endja moda momopalaki yo!» <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Endolo bato bakina ta tei e bobo babalaka: «Yo aheledja miso ma bato ibagwa miso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 9, 6.</char></note>, abwanakiti bokɔ boo Ladjalo adae pɛ bogwa?»<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ladjalo asɔmbi ta mohelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu alumaka na ndjokwa mɛnɛ, akɛkɛ ta ikila. Ikila imina idaka ibanga inɛnɛ itɔmɔkɔ ipose, ko idipamaka ta monɔkɔ na ibanga. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu abalaka: «Dongedjani ibanga di.» Malata, ngɛnɛ e mowei, abalaka na nde: «Kumu, abwani bokɔso; tengasa enɔi ehele masu manɛi donga amopusei so.» <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Nabalakiti na wɛ boo okadima wenɛke ekumu e Ndjakomba?» <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Badongedjaka ibanga. Yesu angɔdjɔkɔ miso ta busa ko abalaka: «Sesa, naopi misakowa na moda mosɔmbedjini wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Nadjebi boo okasɔmbedjeni seko, endolo nabali tine bato ibi bahikini, bɛngi badime boo wɛ olomini.» <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ngɔngɔ i bobala bea, agamaka na ngulu: «Ladjalo, ima!» <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Mowei aimaka, mɔmɔ na mako manangake na yale esendja boso bohuamake na esendja. Yesu abalaka: «Molodjani ko mokinani akɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inginda tina e bowa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Bayuda banɛnɛ ibaduaka adi Malia ko aenɛkɛbo meako imikɔ Yesu, bamodimeaka. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Endolo bakina ta tei e bobo bakɛkɛ adi bapalusai ko babatɔndeaka meako imikɔ Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na bapalusai babongowanaka ta ibolea inɛnɛ i basuku ba bayuda ko babalaka: «Ebwani so bokɔ nde? Tengasa moto iyo akɔkɔ bimbete bi ngindola binɛnɛ! <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Lokamokina akɔke okobea, bato basusu bamodimeake; na bea bakondji ba Loma baduake abuka tepelo ko na bato ba biso!» <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Omɔti ta tei e bobo, kombe e nde Kaipa, yona odaka nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba ta bianga bia, abalaka na bu: «Otasipoakani eka! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Otasipoakani edi bopele boo moto omɔti agwɛ tine bato basusu ko ekomi esusu edae pɛ bobeha?» <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Enakobea, aibalaka meako midongaka ta malɛno ma nde yo mɛnɛ; endolo elenge adaka yo nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba ta yanga yena, atɛlɛkɛ boo Yesu agwake tine ekomi e bayuda, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />eidaka nongo tine ekomi e bayuda, endolo pongono tine bobaimedja ekomi emɔti bana basusu ba Ndjakomba ibananganaka ta ngando isusu.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Donga ta masu mia, bakondji ba bayuda badimanaka bowa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Na tina emina Yesu aidalaka naikina ta bhuda ta tei e bayuda. Akɛkɛ ta ngando emɔti mbuti na etengelenge, ta ngando ebeaka bo Epalaima<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Epalaima </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Edaka ngando mbuti na kilomɛtɛlɛ tuku ibae ta pamba ekaime modakabusa ta Yelusalɛmɛ.</char></note>, adikamaka oho yo na batingami ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Tɛkɛ e Pasika e bayuda ebatamaka ko bato bakɛkɛ ta ngando e Yelusalɛmɛ tine bosasɛnodja boso bo tɛkɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Badaka bohomba Yesu ko basabaleanaka ta tepelo: «Olɛdjini bo? Aduake ta tɛkɛ kaoko ngasa?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Enakobea bakondji ba banganga Ndjakomba ko na bapalusai bapaka mobeko bomoto akadjeba polo edi Yesu, abatɔnde, bɛngi bamopee.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Malia asuwoi Yesu mosoloa mo so elitindi ta mako</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26, 6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mlk 14, 3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Masu masamano boso bo tɛkɛ e Pasika, Yesu akɛkɛ ta ngando e Betania<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mal 11, 1.</char></note>, ta polo edaka Ladjalo, moto opusoa yo ta tei e bago. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Oho, ayaka mia ma mokɔmedjaka na Malata. Ladjalo adaka omɔti odaka ena ta mesa eyaka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Na bea Malia atombaka molangi i modaka na ekenge e mosoloa moso e itindi, molumake na motuya monɛnɛ imokɔmɔkɔ na mole mokabebo nale. Amosuwoaka mosoloa momina ta mako, ngɔngɔ ahakoaka mako ma Yesu na swɛ i nde. Ndako esusu elumaka na so eitindi e mosoloa momina. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Omɔti o batingami ba Yesu, Yudasi Isikaliota, yona wamokabake, abalaka: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />«Tina ndani otɛkitini mosoloa momina na mikama misato mi palanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Motuya mo mosoloa momina mobwani na iputi i basali mikama misato.</char></note>, tine bopa na batakeli?» <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Aibalaka bea te tine aokeaka batakeli pɛhɛ, endolo tine adaka moubi. Elenge adaka yo mobanei o tɔmbi e iputo, adaka aiba palanga. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Endolo Yesu abalaka: «Mokinani bogo! Akɔi bea tine busa bopuseabinibo. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Odabini seko na batakeli, endolo otadabini na mbi seko.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inginda tina e Ladjalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Emumu e bayuda baokaka gala boo Yesu adaka ta Betania. Baikɛkɛ oto ta tine Yesu, endolo pongono tina e boendja Ladjalo yona osisodjaka Yesu ta ndanda e bago. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjakomba badimanaka pongono bowa Ladjalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />tine bayuda banɛnɛ babatiaka ta tina e nde ko badimeaka Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akwei ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk 11, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19, 28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ngɔngɔ i isu imɔti, emumu e bato ekɛkɛ ta tɛkɛ e Pasika, baokaka boo Yesu adaka bokɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Na bea bato ibadaka boso bo yesu batombaka maango ma mabiya ko baimaka ta ngando enɛnɛ bɛngi bakasakana na nde. Badaka bogama: «Ekumu adi Ndjakomba! Kina boo Ndjakomba adjongoe yona aduake na kombe e Mokondji! Kina boo Ndjakomba andjongoe Kumu o Isalɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokakanedja ta Ndj 118, 25-26. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ekumu </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makomi mayou </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Odjana </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 21, 9.</char></note>!» <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu atombaka mwana o ane ko abakamaka diko i yu, elenge abalaka ikomi:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />«Pɛ bobanga, ngando enɛnɛ e Siona!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Endja, Mokondji o wɛ adoi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Adi ta diko i mwana o ane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dja 9, 9.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Boso mɛnɛ, batingami ba nde baisipoaka meako mimina; endolo ehole angɔndjɔmɔkɔ Yesu ta ekumu, balɛdjɛkɛ ikomi ibalamaka ta tina e nde ko meako mibalaka yo. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Bato basusu badaka engbanga na Yesu ta ehole ebeaka yo na Ladjalo ta ikila ko amosisodjaka ta tei e bago, badaka botɔndɔ gala e meako mienɛkɛbo. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Na tina emina emumu e bato baduaka bosakana na nde tine baokaka gala e bimbete bi ngindola bikɔkɔ yo. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Bapalusai basabaleanaka: «Wɛnɛkɛni, otakɔni naikina eka, tengasa bato basusu bamokimanaka!»<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekenge e Bagɛlɛki bahombi baenɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Enakobea, edaka pongono na ekenge e Bagɛlɛki ibakɛkɛ ta Yelusalɛmɛ tine bokumedja Ndjakomba ta ehole e tɛkɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Babatamaka na Pilipo, yona odaka moto o ngando e Betesaida ta Galilea, ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Tata, lapalaka loenɛ Yesu.» <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Na bea Pilipo akɛkɛ atɔndea Andele, ibea bo babae bakɛkɛ bobala na Yesu meako mimina. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Ehole ebwani boo Mwana o moto akumedjame. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Okobea, nabali na nu, edi soti: mbuma e bule ekadike oko mbuma emɔti emiti pɔɔ ta kpɔtɔ, etagwa. Endolo ekakwa ta kpɔtɔ, ebotake mbuma inɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Iyona apalaka mohelo mo nde, amobungedjake; endolo yona alonaka bosapa ta ngondo ye, amobaneake tine bomɔ bo seko. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Moto akapala bosaleani, akimaneni; na bea mosali o mbi adake pongono ta dɔngɔ idabi mbi ko Sange e mbi akakumedje yona okasaleni.»<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abali tina e bogwa bo nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />«Edɛdi mwembo mo mbi molengesani. Ebwani mbi bobala nde? Nabale: Sesa, heledjani ta ehole ye e saya? Enakobea edi mɛnɛ tine ehole ye enɔngi naimei ta ehole ye. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Sesa, pa ekumu ta kombe e wɛ!» Na bea kɔpi eokamaka donga ta busa: «Naekumedja ehele ko naekumedjakabi.» <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Emumu e bato edaka ena ko baokaka kɔpi, babalaka: «Edi mogamo mo bɛi!» Bakina babalaka: «Obwɛndji abali na nde!» <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Endolo Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Editi tina e mbi kɔpi emina eokame, endolo edi ta tina e bino. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Edɛdi edi ehole ebwani na ngondo bosambedjama; na bea mokondji o ngondo ye adoi adumbama sokolu. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Ko, ehole angɔdjɔmɔbi mbi ta ngondo, natubabi bato basusu adi mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Na ndjea e mibalo mimina, Yesu ainedjaka modumba mo yogo agwake yo. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Emumu e bato bamosɔmbedjaka: «Iso lokaka ta buku i mibeko mi biso boo Kilito adakabi na bomɔ tina e seko. Moda ndani obwani bobala boo mwana o moto adi boangɔdjɔmɔ? Mwana omina o moto nda?» <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu abalaka na bu naikina: «Bohu bodi oko ta tei e bino, endolo moo ehole mokɛkɛ. Dalani ehole edi no na bohu, bɛngi boo modidi mosaka ogbundumoani, tengasa yona adalaka ta modidi ta djebe polo akɛkɛ yo. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Dimeani bohu ehole edi no na bohu, bɛngi oimeni bato ba bohu.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">Bayuda baloni bodimea Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Ngɔngɔ i bobala bea, Yesu akɛkɛ ko abolamaka bohali na bu.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Nongo akɔkɔ yo bimbete bi ngindola binɛnɛ ta miso ma bobo, baimodimeaka. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Na bea ekokedjamaka elenge ebalaka mbaeli o Ndjakomba Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Kumu, odimi bwɛndji bu nda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Kumu aenɛmedji suwea e nde adi nda?»<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Isaya abalaka pongono tina ndani bato bia baimodimeaka:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />«Ndjakomba adipa miso ma bobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Adipa bowɛi bo bobo bɛngi miso ma bobo masakaenɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Bowɛi bo bobo bodae pɛ bosipoama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Endja pongono ta tina ebala Ndjakomba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Milema mi bobo mitasɔmbɔ adi mbi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Tine boo nasabaheledja<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 6, 9-10, elangama ta makoma mayou ma gɛlɛki.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya abalaka bea tine anɛkɛ ekumu e Yesu ko abalaka ta tina e nde. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Na bea, ta tei e bakondji ba bayuda, banɛnɛ ba bobo badimeaka Yesu. Endolo ta bɔɔ bo bapalusai, baimodimeaka ta bohu, basakababudjea ta Sinagoga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja 9, 22.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Tengasa bapalaka ekumu e bato bonɔ e ekumu Ndjakomba.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sambi ta tina e mobalo mo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesu agamaka: «Soti, moto odimeini, adimeiti mbi, endolo adimei yona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Moto yona oenini, aeni yona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Mbi, naduaka boda bo bohu bo ngondo, na bea yona odimeini, abwaniti adae ta modidi. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Moto yona okaka mibalo mi mbi ko atamisaka ta mosala, editi mbi moto waesambedjake; tengasa mbi naduaka tine boheledja bato ba ngondo endolo te bobasambedja. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Moto adaka pɛ bodimeani ko atadimaka mibalo mi mbi, ataneake mosambedji o nde: edi mibalo mi balaka mbi mimosambedjabi ta isu i suka. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Na tina emina, mbi naibalaka na mbi mɛnɛ, endolo Sesa olomani apani yo mɛnɛ mibeko miboanaka na mbi bobala ko boleha. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Ko nadjebaka: mibeko mikapɛ yo boo lokɔe mikapɛ bomɔ bo seko. Na bea, mibalo mabalaka mbi, namibalaka oko elenge ebala Sesa na mbi.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu asosi mako ma batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Edaka boso bo tɛkɛ e Pasika. Yesu adjebaka boo ehole e nde emei tina e bokina ngondo ye ko bokɛ adi Sange e nde. Yo apalaka bato ba nde ibadaka ta ngondo, ko abainedjaka epaeli egbasoake epɛ suka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbunoko ta suka </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Na bonɔ mbunoko ta suka.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesu na batingami ba nde bayaka mia ma mɔmɔkɔ. Djabulu akweaka ehele bopangoa molema mo Yudasi, mwana o Simo Isikaliota, bokaba Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu adjebaka bo yo mɛnɛ adongaka adi Ndjakomba ko asɔmbɔke adi Ndjakomba. Adjebaka pongono boo Sesa apaka misusu ta bokondji bo nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Asongɔdjɔkɔ ta mesa, adongedjaka mokoto mo nde, atombi ehakoi ko asadingaka ta bongo bo nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ngɔngɔ, i boisa madiba ta ebaeli ko abangaka bososa mako ma batingami ba nde; ngɔngɔ abahakoaka na ehakoi emina. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ehole eimeaka engbanga e Simo Piɛlɛ, yo abalaka na Yesu: «Kumu, wapalaka ososeni mako!» <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Edɛdi odjebiti eka epali mbi bokɔ, endolo wadjebake ngɔngɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Piɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Ngasa, otasosakani oto mako!» Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Namiti ososa mako, oditi na ibondo ta bodieli bo seko.» <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simo Piɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Na bea, Kumu, otasosakani oto mako, endolo sosani pongono mɔmɔ na molo!» <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Yona osasosi aditi na tina na bosasosa, emiti da oko mako; tengasa asɛnɔi mɛnɛ. Omeini basɛnɔke, endolo editi no basusu.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu adjebaka moto yona amokabake; na tina emina abalaka: «Oditini no basusu basɛnɔke.»<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ngɔngɔ ibobasosa bo basusu mako, Yesu alwaka esendja e nde, adaka naikina ta mesa ko abalaka na bu: «Odjebini meako misokɔni mbi? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Okabenini “Molehi” ko “Kumu”, ko odini na molonga, tengasa nadi mɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Ibea ekada mbi, Kumu ko Molehi, nososini mako, ino pongono otungini bosasosani mako. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Noinedjini moda mo mbi bɛngi ino pongono okwaneni elenge ekɔini mbi. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Okobea, notɔndeini, edi soti: mosali ta nɔe mokondji o nde ko molomani ta nɔe yona omolomaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta milɔngɔ 12-16 ko Luk 22, 24-27.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Edɛdi odjebini meako mi mina; wadakeni bato basepi, okasaledeani meako mimina. <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Natabalaka tina e no basusu; nadjebaka bia ibahɔ mbi. Endolo etungi ikomi i mobalo ikokedjame: “Yona ayaka na mbi sani emɔti, aimei moloni o mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 41, 10.</char></note>.” <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Oko edɛdi nabali na nu, boso bo midjɔ mimina mikɔmee, tine ehole ekɔmɔkemo, dimani boo “nadi”. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Okobea, nabali na nu, edi soti: moto oasɔi yona olomi mbi, asɔini pongono; ko yona oasɔini, asɔi yona olomani.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjebedji boo Yudasi amokabake</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26, 20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mlk 14, 17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22, 21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Ngɔngɔ i Yesu bobala bea, mwembo mo nde asatungeaka ta tei e molema ko abalaka: «Okobea, nabali na nu, edi soti: Omɔti o bino akabakeni.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Batingami baimeaka bosedjana ko bosahɔdjɔnɔ tine bodjeba moto obalaka yo. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Omɔti o batingami, yona opalaka Yesu, adaka mbuti na nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simo Piɛlɛ amoniteaka bɛngi ahɔdje Yesu amotɔndee moto yona obalaka tina e nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Motingami omina aekɛmɛkɛ adi Yesu ko amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Kumu, omina nda?» <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Nadoi adubea ekenge e mwɛmbɛ ta mosua: yona apake mbi, edi yo.» Yesu atombaka ekenge e mwɛmbɛ, adubeaka ko eapaka na Yudasi, mwana o Simo Isikaliota. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Na bea ehole etombaka Yudasi ekenge e mwɛmbɛ, Satana akweaka ta tei e nde. Yesu abalaka na nde: «Modjɔ mopalaka wɛ okɔe, mokɔ pɛpɛlɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Pɛ nongo omɔti adi bia ibadaka ta mesa, odjebaka tina epalaka Yesu bobala bea. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Elenge apeaka Yudasi tɔmbi e iputo, banɛnɛ balɛdjɛkɛ boo Yesu amohɔdjɔkɔ akɛe asomba leka ilobwanaka na tɛkɛ, kaoko akɛe apa ikabo adi batakeli. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Na bea Yudasi atombaka ekenge e mwɛmbɛ ko aimaka mbala emɔti. Edaka na bulu.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mobeko mo yanie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ngɔngɔ i Yudasi boima, Yesu abalaka: «Edɛdi ekumu e Mwana o Moto enɛmi ko ekumu e Ndjakomba asinedji adi yo. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />[Ekada ekumu e Ndjakomba esinedji ta tei e nde,]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makomi makina maditi na kombe </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ko ekumu e Ndjakomba esinedji adi yo.</char></note> Ndjakomba pongono, apake ekumu adi Mwana ko ainedjake napɛ ekoka. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Bana ba mba, nadi na nu baasu bakɛkɛ. Ohombabini, endolo nabalaka na nu edɛdi elenge ebalaka mbi na bayuda: Otakokakeni bokɛ ta dɔngɔ lakɛke mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 7, 34.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Naopakani mobeko moyanie: palanani ino na ino. Etungi opalaneni moda mopalani mbi. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Ekada bo opalanini ino na ino, na bea bato basusu badjebake boo odini batingami ba mbi.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu adjebedji boo Piɛlɛ amoinganake</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:3-35">Mat 26, 3-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-34">Luk 22, 3-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simo Piɛlɛ amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Kumu, akɛke wɛ djɔ?» Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Ta dɔngɔ lakɛke mbi, otakimanakeni edɛdi; endolo okimanabini ta masu maduake.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Piɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Kumu, tina edi mbi pɛ bokimana edɛdi nda? Nadi mbuti bopa bomɔ bo mbi tine wɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Odi mɛnɛ mbuti bopa bomɔ wɛ tina e mbi! Okobea, nabali na wɛ, edi soti: Boso boo kɔkɔ akɔkɔle, wɛ oinganeakeni mbala isato boo otadjebakani.»<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu adi ndjea e bokɛ adi Sesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Kina milema mi bino midae pɛ bosatungea. Dani na edimeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dani na edimeli </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kaoko odi na edimeli.</char></note> adi Ndjakomba ko dimani mbi pongono. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Bisika bidi binɛnɛ ta ndako e Sesa; emitida bea nakɔki odjebedjani boo nakɛkɛ aobɔngedjeani bisika? <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Ko ngɔngɔ i bokɛ aobɔngedjeani bisika, naduake ko naotombakeni mbuti na mbi, bɛngi ino pongono odaeni ta dɔngɔ idake mbi. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Wadjebakani ndjea ekɛkɛ mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Toma abalaka na nde: «Kumu, lotadjebaka polo ekɛke wɛ. Lodi bodjeba ndjea emina moda nda?» <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Mbi nadi ndjea, soti ko bomɔ. Moto aboaniti bokɛ adi Sesa emiti da oko na mbi. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Ekadabo odjebinini, okɔkidjebani pongono Sesa. Ko donga edɛdi omodjebini ko omoenini.» <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Pilipo abalaka na nde: «Kumu, loinedja Sesa ko ladake nasepi.» <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Pilipo, ehole eyai edi mbi na nu ko wɛ otadjebakani? Yona oenini, aeni Sesa. Tina abalaka wɛ: “Loinedja Sesa?” <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Otadimaka mbi nadi ta tei e Sesa ko Sesa ta tei e mbi? Mibalo miobaleakani mbi miidonga adi mbi. Edi Sesa yona odi ta tei e mbi, akokedjaka misala mi nde mɛnɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Dimeanini ehole abalaka mbi: nadi ta tei e Sesa ko Sesa ta tei e mbi. Emitikoda bea, dimani nongo tine misala mieni no mbi bosala. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Okobea, nabalaka na nu, edi soti: yona adimeakani akɔke pongono misala makɔkɔ mbi. Amikɔke minɛnɛ bonɔ, tine boo nakɛkɛ adi Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Ko nakɔke misusu misɛngɛkɛbi bino ta kombe e mbi, bɛngi Mwana ainedje ekumu e Sange e nde. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Eka esusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eka esɛngɛkɛbino </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makomi makina maditi na mu.</char></note> esɛngɛkɛbi no ta kombe e mbi, naekɔkɔbi.»<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuno e boloma Mwembo Mosɛnɔke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />«Okapalanini, osumabini mobeko mi mbi. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Nasɛngɛkɛbi na Sesa aopɛni mobaeli okina, tine aokamoakeni ko adae na nu tina e seko. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Adi Mwembo mosoti. Ngondo ebwaniti amoasɔe, tine eboaniti nongo amoenɛ ko amodjebe. Endolo ino, wamodjebakeni, tine ayeyoabi na nu ko adakabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Modakabi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina mayou mabalaka </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Madi.</char></note> seko na nu. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Natokinabini no bɛnɛ elenge bana ba madinda; nasɔmbɔbi adi no. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Mooehole mokɛkɛ ngondo etaenɛkeni naikina, endolo no, wenɛkenini, tine boo mbi nadi na bomɔ ko ino wadakeni na bomɔ pongono. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Ta busa bomina, osipoabini boo nahelaka iputo na Sesa ko ino odini iputo na mbi ko mbi na nu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />«Moto yona abaneake mibeko mi mbi ko amisumaka, adi yona apalakani. Sange e mbi apalakabi yona opalini; mbi pongono namopalabi ko nasinedjabi na nde.» <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda, te Yudasi Isikaliota, abalaka na nde: «Kumu, moda ndani moboani wɛ bosinedja na su endolo te na ngondo?» <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Moto yona opalini, asumake mibalo mabalaka mbi. Sange e mbi amopalabi; Sange e mbi ko mbi loduabi bodikama ta tei e nde. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Moto yona adaka pɛ bopalani, tasumake mibalo mi mbi. Mibalo miokaka no mbi bobala mitadongaka adi mbi, endolo adi Sange e mbi yona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Nabalaka mibalo imi misusu ehole edi mbi oko na nu. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Mobaeli yona oduabi bokamoani edi Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. Sesa amolomabi ta kombe e mbi, tine bolehani meako misusu ko bolɛdjɛni meako misusu mibalaka mbi na nu.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />«Nokineini bogo ko nopini bogo bo mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 9, 5.</char></note>. Natopakani bogo bomina elenge moda mo ngondo. Milema mi bino midae pɛ bosatungea ko pɛ bodani na bɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Okani nabala na nu: “Nakɛke, endolo nasɔmbɔke adi no.” Osopalanini, okɔki sepani bodjeba boo nakɛke adi Sesa, tine Sesa anɔini. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Nabalaka na nu meako imi edɛdi boso boo mimee, bɛngi ehole eimeabi mo odimeni. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Nabaletebi naikina na nu bobuke, tengasa kumu o ngondo ye adoi. Aditi na kpati diko i mbi, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />endolo bato ba ngondo badjebake boo nakapale Sesa ko nakakɔe elenge akabale yo na mbi nakɔe. Angɔni, lodongeni iya!»<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Vino epele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Mbi nadi soti mole mo vino ko Sesa adi moswa gbie e vino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 5, 1-4.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Akondoake bitape bisusu, ibitingi adi mbi, ko idaka pɛ bobota mbuma; endolo akondoake tɔɔlɔ ta bitape ikabote mbuma bɛngi ibote inɛnɛ bonɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Ino, odini ehele basɛnɔke ta tine mobalo mosolehani mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Yeyoani iputo na mbi, ko mbi nayeyoake iputo na nu. Etape ebwaniti bobota mbuma yo mɛnɛ, emiti da etingi na mole; oko moda momɔti, ino obwanitini bobota mbuma omiti dani iputo na mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Nadi soti mole mo vino, ino odini bitape. Moto yona oputoani na mbi ko mbi iputo na nde, adi bobota mbuma inɛnɛ, tengasa otakɔni eka pɛ mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Moto amiti da iputo na mbi, adumbamake sokolu elenge etape ekakana. Enakobea bitape ibikakana, bakabiandoe ko bakabidumbe ta mosa ko boangoaka. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Okadani iputo na mbi ko mibalo mi mbi miyeyoi adi no, hɔdjɔni eka epalaka no ko oediabini. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Sange e mbi akakumedjame ekada boo obotini mbuma inɛnɛ ko ainedjamake boo odini batingami ba mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Mbi nakopaleni elenge Sange mbi akapaleni yo. Yeyoani ta tei e epaeli e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Okasumani mibeko mi mbi, wayeyoakeni ta tei e epaeli e mbi, elenge oko akasume mbi mibeko mi Sange e mbi ko nakayeyoe ta tei e epaeli e nde.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />«Nabali na nu bea, bɛngi boo sepi e mbi edae adi no ko sepi e bino edae ekokake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 9, 2; 35, 10.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Endja mobeko mo mbi: Palanani ino na ino elenge aopalani mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Epaeli enɔi na bonɛnɛ, edi bopa bomɔ bo nde tine ba binande. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Ino odini binambi, okakɔni eka ekohɔdjeni mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Nataobeakani naikina basali, tine mosali tadjebe eka ekakɔe moswande. Nakobeni binambi, tine boo nodjebedjani meako misusu imikoa mbi na Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Ino oihɔni mbi, mbi moto oohɔni. Nopini elomu okɛni, bobota mbuma ko mbuma ipingake. Na bea, Sesa aopabini meako misusu mihɔdjɔkɔbino ta kombe e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Na bea eka eohɔdjɔkɔni mbi, edi palanani.»<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngondo eloni Yesu na batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Ekada ngondo ekolonani, djebani boo elonani boso bo bino. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Akokino dani bato ba ngondo, ngondo ekɔki opalani tine odini bato ba yu. Endolo mbi nohɔni bɛngi odaeni sokolu e ngondo, oditini naikina bato ba ngondo: na tina emina ngondo eolonini. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Lɛdjɛni ehele mibalo mibala mbi na nu: «Mosali ta nɔe mokondji o nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 10, 24; Luk 6, 40; Yoa 13, 16.</char></note>.» Ekada bato bonɔngedjani, bonɔngedjabini pongono; ekada basuma eleho e mbi, basumabi pongono bi bino. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Endolo baokɔbini midjɔ misusu mimina ta tina e kombe e mbi, tine batadjebaka yona olomani. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Nasonada pɛ bodua ko nosonada pɛ bobatɔndea, baikɔkɔ da na lindo. Endolo edɛdi baditi na boyɛmɛ tine mabe ma bobo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Yona alonakani, aloni pongono Sange e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Baikɔkɔ kwa ta lindo nasonada pɛ bokɔ ta tei e bobo misala imida moto pɛ bokɔ. Na bea, edɛdi, baeni misala, balonini ko na Sange e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Endolo meako misusu mibwani boimea tine bokokedja mobalo imokomama ta mobeko mo bobo: «Balonani napɛ tina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 35, 19; 69, 5.</char></note>»<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />«Mobaeli yona ookamoakabini aduabi: adi Mwembo mosoti yona adongake adi Sesa. Mbi nolomeakeni yo ta kombe e Sesa ko abalake tati ta tina e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Ko no pongono, opabini tati tina e mbi, tengasa odakani na mbi donga ta mbangi.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />«Nabala na nu bea tine osaka kinani edimeli. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Bobudjeakabini ta ba Sinagoga. Edabi ta ehole emɔti eduabi, bato bowabini, balɛdjɛbi boo na bokɔ bea, basaleaka Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Bakɔkɔ bea tine baidjebaka Sesa ko mbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Endolo nabalaka na nu bea, ehole ekimeabi, lɛdjɛni meako mibalaka mbi na nu.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Mosala mo Mwembo Mosɛnɔke</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«Nabalaka na nu meako mi donga mbangi, tine boo nadaka na nu.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Mosala mo Mwembo Mosɛnɔke</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">Nabalakiti bea donga ta mbangi, tengasa nadaka na nu. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Edɛdi, nakɛi adi yona olomani ko pɛ moto ta ndanda e bino obwani bohɔdjɔni: «Okɛi djɔɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Endolo tine notɔndeini bea, ndjokwa elumi na nu ta milema. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Enakobea, Mbi notɔndeini soti: edi bopele tine mbi boyana; na bea namiti yana, yona obwani bodua elenge Mobaeli abwaniti bodua. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Endolo ehole eduabi yo, adjebedjabi adi bato mabunga ma bobo ta tina e mabe, ta bodjo ko ta bosambedja bo Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bik 24, 25.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Ta tina e modjɔ moendji bobe, edi tine boo batadimeakani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 8, 21-24; 9, 41; 15, 22-24.</char></note>; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />ta tine e modjɔ moendji bodjo, edi tine boo nakɛkɛ adi Sesa ko oenɛtebinini naikina; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />ta tine modjɔ moendji bodjo, edi tine boo mokondji o ngondo ye asambedjama ehele.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />«Nadi na meako minɛnɛ mi botɔndeani, endolo otabwanakeni bomihɔnɔ edɛdi. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ehole eduabi Mwembo mosoti, aodaledjabini ta bosoti bosusu. Abaletebi na kombe e nde mɛnɛ, endolo abalabi misusu imiokaka yo ko aotɔndeabini meako maduake. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ainedjabi ekumu e mbi, tengasa adiabi yena edi adi mbi ko aodjebedjakabini. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Losusu lopeli Sesa lodi pongono lo mbi. Na tina emina nabali boo Mwembo atombakabi imidi adi mbi ko aodjebakabini.»<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndjokwa ehombanabi sepi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />«Ngɔngɔ mweka otenɛkenini, namoehole mokɛkɛ oenɛkenini naikina.» <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Ekenge e batingami ba nde babaleanaka: «Apalaka yo abale nde? “Ngɔngɔ mweka otenɛkenini, na moehole mokɛkɛ oenɛkenini naikina”, ko pongono: “edi tine boo nakɛke adi Sesa.” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Mibalo mi etingodjaka mo nde? “Na moehole mokɛkɛ” Lotasipoaka meako mabalaka yo.» <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu asipoaka boo bapalaka bamohɔdje. Abalaka na bu: «Edi tine mibalo mi: ngɔngɔ mweka otenɛkenini, na moehole mokɛkɛ oenɛkenini naikina; wapalakani bosahɔdjɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Okobea, nabalaka na nu, edi soti: oyeabini ko osatungeabini, enakobea bato ba ngondo badabi na sepi. Odabini na ndjokwa, endolo ndjokwa e bino ehombanabi sepi. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Ehole ahombaka mwali abote, akaime bosatungea, tine boo ehole e nde e saya eimei. Endolo ehole eboti yo mwana, abosi saya isusu ko alumi na mongandi boenɛ boo moto adoi ta ngondo na ndjea e nde. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Oko moda momina, ino pongono wasatungeakeni edɛdi. Endolo noenɛbini naikina ko milema mi bino misepabi, na bea moto o bokatoani sepi emina adaetebi. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />«Ehole eimeabi busa bomina, ohɔdjetebini nongo eka. Soti, nabalaka na nu, edi soti: Sesa aopabini misusu mihɔdjɔkɔbino ta kombe e mbi. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mbunoko edɛdi, opakitini ahɔdjɔ eka na kombe e mbi. Sengeni ko wadiakeni, na bea sepi e bino eimeake e bokoka.»<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu molongi o ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />«Nabalaka na nu meako misusu na masɛ. Ehole eduake nataake bala naikina masɛ, endolo nodjebedjakeni bohu mɛnɛ ta tina e Sesa. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Ta busa bomina, osɛngɛkɛbini Sesa na kombe e mbi; ko nabaliti na nu boo naongɔnɔke Sesa ta tina e bino, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />tengasa Sesa yo mɛnɛ akopaleni. Akopaleni tine boo ino okapalenini ko okadimeni boo nadonga adi Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nadonga adi Sesa ko naimei ta ngondo. Edɛdi nadongi ta ngondo ko nasɔmbi adi Sesa.» <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Na bea batingami ba nde babalaka: «Endja edɛdi obali bohu mɛnɛ, napɛ bobala na masɛ! <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Edɛdi losipoi boo wɛ okadjebe meako misusu ko oditi na posa boamba bohɔdje. Na tina emina lodimi boo odonga adi Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Odimini edɛdi? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Ehole edoi, eimei ehele, wapatanganakeni moto na moto ta dɔngɔ idonga yo, ko wakinakenini mbi mɛnɛ. Endolo naditi mbi mɛnɛ, tengasa Sesa adi na mbi engbanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Nodjebedjakani meako misusu bɛngi odaeni bogo iputo na mbi. Wenɛkɛni saya ta ngondo. Endolo sapingedjani! Mbi nalongi ngondo!»<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aongɔni tina e batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Ngɔngɔ i bobala bea, Yesu angɔdjɔ miso ta busa ko aongɔnɔkɔ: «Sesa, ehole eimei. Inedja ekumu e Mwana o wɛ, bɛngi Mwana pongono ainedje ekumu e wɛ! <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Tengasa omopa kpatsi diko i bato basusu, tine boo apɛ mohelo mo seko adi bia ibamopa wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Mohelo mo seko modi: bodjeba boo wɛ odi Ndjakomba oko omɔti o soti ko yona oloma wɛ, Yesu Kilito. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Nainedji ekumu e wɛ ta ngondo; nasidji mosala mopani wɛ bokɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Ko edɛdi Sesa, pani ekumu yena edaka na mbi ta boso bo wɛ, boso bo ngondo ekɔme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1, 1-2.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Nakɔi boo nosipodje wɛ adi bato bia badongedja wɛ ta ngondo ko obapani. Badaka bato ba wɛ ko obapani; ko basumi mobalo mo wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Edɛdi badjebi misusu imipani wɛ, midongaka soti adi wɛ, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />tengasa nabapi mibalo imipakani wɛ ko bamidimi. Basipoi soti mɛnɛ boo nadongaka adi wɛ ko wɛ olomani.»<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Naongɔni tina e bobo. Naongɔniti tine ngondo, endolo tina e bia ibapani wɛ, tengasa badi bato ba wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Bato basusu ibadi ba wɛ, badi ba mbi; ekumu e mbi einedjami ta tei e bobo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Edɛdi naditi ta ngondo naikina, endolo bo badi oko ta ngondo, enakobea mbi nakɛkɛ adi wɛ. Sesa mosɛnɔke, babanea na kpati e kombe e wɛ, bia ipapani wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babanea... Ibapani wɛ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina madi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Na kpati e bo Ndjakomba, banea bia ibapani wɛ.</char></note>, bɛngi badae omɔti elenge mbi na wɛ lodi omɔti. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ehole edaka mbi engbanga na bu, nababaneaka na kpati e kombe e wɛ, kombe yena epani wɛ. Nababaneaka ko omɔti o bobo aibeha, dongedja oko yona odaka bo abunge, tine boo ikomi ikokedjame. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Edɛdi nahuli adi wɛ. Na bea nabalaka ta ehole edi mbi ta ngondo, bɛngi boo badae na sepi ta tei e bobo, sepi ekokake. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Nabapi mobalo mo wɛ ko ngondo ebapaliti tine boo baditi bato ba ngondo, elenge adi mbi pɛ boda moto o ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Natongɔnɔkɔ obadongedje ta ngondo, endolo babanea ta boso bo satana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 6, 13. Mikomi makina mabali: babanea ta bobe.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Baditi bato ba ngondo ye, elenge mbi naditi moto o ngondo ye. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Bahɛngɛ boo badae mɛnɛ adi wɛ ta ndjea e bosoti; tine boo mobalo wɛ modi soti. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Nabalomi ta ngondo elenge alomani wɛ ta ngondo. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Nasahɛngi na bosusu adi wɛ tine bobo, bɛngi bo pongono, badae bahɛngɛmɛke adi wɛ na ndjea e soti.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />«Natongɔnɔkɔ oko tine e bobo pɛ, endolo pongono tina e bia ta ndjea e mibalo mi bobo, bamodimeabi. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Nongɔnɔkɔ tina e bobo basusu badae omɔti. Sesa, kina boo badae ta iputo i mbi na wɛ, elenge wɛ odi iputo na mbi ko mbi nadi iputo na wɛ. Badae omɔti bɛngi ngondo edime boo olomani. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Nabapi ekumu epani wɛ, bɛngi badae omɔti elenge mbi na wɛ lodi omɔti; <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />mbi ta tei e wɛ ko wɛ ta tei e mbi. Badae mɛnɛ omɔti, tine boo bato ba ngondo badjebe boo wɛ olomani ko okabapale elenge akapaleni wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Sesa, wɛ obapani ko nadi na posa badae na mbi ta dɔngɔ idi mbi; bɛngi boo baenɛ ekumu e mbi, ekumu epani wɛ, tengasa opalani boso bo ngondo ekɔme. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Sesa, wɛ odi Bodjo, bato ba ngondo baidjebaka wɛ, endolo mbi nodjebaka ko bo basipoi boo wɛ olomani. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Noinedja adi bo kombe e wɛ ko nakɔke boo bodjebe naikina bonɔ, bɛngi epaeli einedjani wɛ edae ta tei e bobo ko nadae ta tei e bobo.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bopeama bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26, 47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14, 43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22, 47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Ngɔngɔ i bobala bea, Yesu akɛ na batingami ba nde ta dɔngɔ ikina i ibɛngɛ ibeakabo Sedelɔne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 11, 1.</char></note>. Akweaka na batingami ba nde ta gbie emɔti edaka oho. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yudasi, yona omokababi, adjebaka pongono polo emina, tine boo Yesu ko batingami ba nde badaka na elama e bosonganaka oho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Luk 21, 37; 22, 39.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Na bea Yudasi adalaka boso bo engbanga e basoda na babanei bia bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko bapalusai bamopakabo. Aimea ta gbie emina engbanga na bato bapelamaki milodji, tanda ko bipeko. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Elenge Yesu adjebaka midjɔ misusu mibwanaka bomoimea, akɛkɛ boso bo bobo ko abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Wahombakano nda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Yesu o Nasaleta.» Yesu abalaka na bu: «Edi mbi.» Ko Yudasi yona omokababi, adaka pongono ena engbanga na bu. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Ehole ebalaka Yesu na bu: «Edi mbi,» basɔmbɔkɔ ngɔngɔ ko bakwakaka ta kpɔtɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu abahɔdjɔkɔ naikina: «Wahombakano nda?» Bomosɔmbedjaka: «Yesu o Nasaleta.» <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Nabali na nu ehele, edi mbi. Edaka boo ohombakanini, kinani bato bakina bayane.»<verse eid="JHN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Edaka tine bokokedjama bo mobalo mobalaka yo: «Nabungedjiti nongo omɔti o bobo ta bia ibapani wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simo Piɛlɛ adaka na mopamba; amoiwaka ko alenaka mosali o nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba itoi i ebɔ e bami. Mosali omina bamobeaka na kombe e Malukusu. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Endolo Yesu abalaka na Piɛlɛ: «Sɔmbedja mopamba mo wɛ ta igbogbo! Olɛdjɛkɛ boo nata mwake kɔbɔ e saya yena epani Sesa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Mat 26, 39; Mal 14, 36; Luk 22, 42.</char></note>?»<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakɛi na Yesu adi Ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Engbanga e basoda na mokondji o bobo ko babanei ba bayuda bapeaka Yesu, bamonangaka mbɔti. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Bakɛkɛ na nde boso mɛnɛ adi Ana, yona odaka bokio bo Kaipa ko nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba ta bianga bimina. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Enakobea edaka Kaipa moto opaka ilako adi bakondji ba bayuda: «Otasipoakani edi bopele boo moto omɔti agwɛ tine bato basusu ko ekomi esusu edae pɛ bobeha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 11, 49-50.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piɛlɛ aingani aditi motingami o Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26, 69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mlk 14, 66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22, 55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simo Piɛlɛ ko motingami okina bakimanaka Yesu. Motingami omina adjebanaka bopele na nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba ko akweaka na Yesu ta ikanga i bopango bo ndako bo nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Endolo Piɛlɛ adikaka sokolu, mbuti na ekukɛ. Na bea, motingami okina, yona odjebanaka bopele na nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba, aimanaka sokolu ko abalaka na mwali yona odaka sindjili o ekukɛ, ko akwedjaka Piɛlɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Mosali mwali yona odaka sindjili o ekukɛ abalaka na Piɛlɛ: «Wɛ oditi pongono, omɔti o batingami ba moto yonaoo?» Abalaka: «Ngasa, te mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Basali ko basindjili badaka ena; bawanedjaka mosa, tengasa piɔ edaka epipo ko baokaka mosa. Piɛlɛ adaka na bu ko aokaka mosa pongono.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nganga monɛnɛ asambedji Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26, 59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk 14, 55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22, 66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Na bea Nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba aimeaka bosambedja Yesu ta midjɔ miendji ba batingami ba nde ko na bileho bilehaka yo. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Nabalaka ta bohu na bato basusu ba ngondo; nalehaka ta ba sinagoga, ta tepelo, ko ta polo iputoanaka bayuda basusu; naibalaka ta mbombi. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Ohɔdjɔkɔnini tina nda? Hɔdjɔni bato bia baokaka meako midaka mbi bobala: badjebaka bopele, meako ndani mibalaka mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Na bobala bea, omɔti o babanei odaka ena, abomaka Yesu epapata ko abalaka: «Edi moda mobwani na wɛ bosɔmbedja nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba?» <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Nakabala eka emɔti ebe, inedjani bobe bomina; endolo tati e bali mbi ekada soti, tina ndani ebomini wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Na bea Ana amolomaka, monangamake na mbɔti adi Kaipa, nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piɛlɛ aingani naikina Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26, 71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mlk 14, 69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22, 58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Ta ehole emina, Simo Piɛlɛ, yo adikaka ena aoka mosa. Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Wɛ oditi pongono omɔti o batingami ba moto yo?» Endolo Piɛlɛ ainganaka: «Ngasa, te mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Okina mosali o nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba, odaka sange e moto yona olenaka Piɛlɛ itoi, abalaka na nde: «Naonɛkiti wɛ na nde ta gbie?» <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Endolo Piɛlɛ ainganaka naikina. Ko na mbala emɔti kɔkɔ akɔkɔlɔkɔ.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu boso bo Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27, 1-2-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk 15, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Baimana na Yesu adi Kaipa ko bakakwea na nde adi gupɛnɛlɛ o Baloma, edaka ehuma mɛnɛ. Endolo bakondji ba bayuda ibakɛkɛ na Yesu ta ndako e gupɛnɛlɛ, baikweaka oho; basaka saimedja mbindo, tine boyaka mia ma pasika. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Na tina emina gupɛnɛlɛ Pilato aimaka sokulu bobatanea. Abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Modjɔ mopundaka na nu moto iyo nda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Amiti da moto mobe, lobwaniti bodua amopunda!» <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato abalaka na bu: «Motombani ino bɛnɛ ko mosambedjani elenge mobeko mo bino.» Bayuda bamosɔmbedjaka: «Lotungiti bodumba moto ta bogwa.»<verse eid="JHN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Bɛngi boo ekokedjame mibalo misusu mibalaka Yesu, tine etingodje moda mo bogwa modaka na nde agwɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Na bea Pilato akweaka naikina ta ndako e nde. Aimanaka na Yesu ko amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Odi Mokondji o bayuda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Obali bea wɛ mɛnɛ kaoko bato bakina babali na wɛ tina e mbi?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato asɔmbedjaka: «Mbi naimei moyuda? Bato bia ba ekomi e wɛ ko bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba baopundi adi mbi, modjɔ mokɔi wɛ nda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Bokumu bo mbi boditi bokumu bo ngondo ye; ekadabo bokumu bo mbi bodae bo ngondo ye, basali ba mbi bakɔki ana bila tine mbi, bɛngi nadae pɛ bopama ta mɔmɔ ma bakondji ba bayuda. Endolo ngasa, bokumu bo mbi boditi bo ngondo ye.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Na bea Pilato abalaka na nde: «Odi mɛnɛ Kumu?» Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Wɛ moto obali boo: nadi Mokondji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obali: nadi Kumu </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Wɛ obali nadi Kumu.</char></note>. Nabotama ko nadua ta ngondo tine bopa tati ta tina e soti. Moto odi ta dɔngɔ i soti, akɔke meako mikabale mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato amohɔdji naikina: «Edi soti nde?»</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Balenei Yesu etumbo e bogwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27, 15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mlk 15, 6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23, 13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Ngɔngɔ imibalo mia, Pilato aimaka naikina adi bayuda ko abalaka na bu: «Naeniti nongo modjɔ moboloma momi yo ta bogwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Elenge alamano na bokɔkɔ bo di na nu, botingoa mobɔlɔkɔ omɔti ta enɔeli ta tɛkɛ e Pasika. Wapalakani notingoeni Mokondji o bayuda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Bamosɔmbedjaka na bogama: «Ngasa, te moto yona! Endolo Balaba moto apalaka so!» Enakobea, Balabase adaka mowoi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bik 3, 14.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Na bea Pilato abalaka baimedje Yesu ko bamobome mbalake. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Basoda bayoaka egbala endjubɛ, baebakeaka Yesu ta molo ko bamolwadjaka esendja ekpetu<note caller="+" style="f">Babakamaka, basɛpi na mɔmɔ, baigwaka pɛpɛlɛ. Bababukaka mako, na bobasia botomba eka ko bobadaledja pɛpɛlɛ bagwɛ.<char style="fr" closed="false">19, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esendja ekpetu: </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mal 15, 17.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Babatamaka mbuti na nde ko babalaka: «Bwanda, Mokondji o bayuda!» Ko bamobomaka. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato aimaka naikina ko abalaka na bayuda: «Ambani, nadoi amoimedja sokolu, bɛngi odjebeni boo nadihiti nongo modjɔ mobe tine bolenea moto iyo etumbo e bogwa.» <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Na bea Yesu aimaka; alwaka egbala e ndjubɛ ko esendja ekpetu. Ko Pilato abalaka na bu: «Endjani moto!» <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Endolo ehole emoenɛkɛ bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na babanei, bagamaka: «Mobaka ta ekulusu! Mobaka ta ekulusu!» Pilato abalaka na bu: «Kɛni amobakeni no bɛnɛ ta ekulusu, tengasa mbi nadihiti modjɔ mobe mo bomolenea etumbo e bogwa.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Bayuda bamosɔmbedjaka: «Lodi na mobeko ko bokimana mobeko momina atungi na bogwa, tengasa asimedjaka boo adi Mwana o Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bal 24, 16.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Ehole eokaka Pilato mibalo mimina, aimeaka naikina na bɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Akweaka ta ndako ko ahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu: «Odi oekomi nda?» Endolo Yesu aimosɔmbedjaka. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Na bea Pilato abalaka na nde: «Oloni bosɔmbedjani? Otadjebaka mbi nadi na kpatsi e botingoa ko pongono ebobakedja ta ekulusu?» <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Akɔki wɛ da na kpatsi diko i mbi emitida yena epamaka na wɛ donga o diko. Na tina emina, moto yona okabini adi wɛ adi na lindo bonɔ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Oko ta ehole emina, Pilato ahombaka enɔi e botingoa Yesu. Endolo bayuda bagamaka: «Okatingoa momi iyo, oditi mwange e Sedjale! Moto yona wasatukoaka mokondji, adi moloni o Sedjale!» <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Ngɔngɔ i Pilato boka mibalo mimina, aimedjaka Yesu sokolu; adaa o diko ta polo e esambi ekabebo «Gabata» ta monɔkɔ mo baebele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gabata etingodji polo edi o diko.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Edaka busa bo mosalingo mo tɛkɛ e Pasika, ta ngonga e midi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edi ta ehole e</char><char style="fp" closed="false">Midi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Busa buwa, ibowaka bo bana ba pate tine tɛkɛ e Pasika. </char></note>. Pilato abalaka na bayuda: «Endjani mokondji o bino!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Endolo bagamaka: «Agwɛ! Agwɛ! Mobaka ta ekulusu!» Pilato abalaka na bu: «Wapalakani nabake kumu o bino ta ekulusu?» Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba basɔmbedjaka: «Loditi na kumu okina oko Sedjale.» <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Na bea Pilato abapaka Yesu, bɛngi bamobake ta ekulusu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu abakami ta ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27, 32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk 15, 21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23, 26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Na bea bakɛkɛ na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu atombaka ekulusu e nde yo mɛnɛ, aimaka ta ngando enɛnɛ ta polo ebeamaka «Egɔgɔlɔ e molo» ebeamaka «Gologota» ta monɔkɔ mo baebele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gologota </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kombe e alama etingodji </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Egɔgɔlɔ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Edi mogangala odi mbuti na ngando enɛnɛ</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Edaka oho polo ebakaka ba soda Yesu ta ekulusu. Oko ta ehole emina, babakaka bami bakina babae ta ekulusu, omɔti ta ebɔ e bami okina ta ebɔ e bali Yesu adaka ndanda e bobo. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato atombaka moibaya o ikomi ko aibakaka ta diko i ekulusu. Bakomaka ta ibaya imina: «Yesu o Nasaleta, mokondji o bayuda.» <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Bayuda banɛnɛ balangaka ikomi imina, tengasa polo ebakabo Yesu ta ekulusu edaka mbuti na ngando enɛnɛ. Ikomi imina ikomama na monɔkɔ mo baebele, na latɛ ko na gɛlɛki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Na bea bakondji ba banganga ba bayuda babalaka na Pilato: «Pɛ bokoma ikomi di “kumu o bayuda,” endolo obwani bokoma: “Moto yona abalaka, adi kumu o bayuda.”» <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato asombedjaka: «Eka ekomi mbi, ediki oko bea.»<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ngɔngɔ i basoda bobaka Yesu ta ekulusu, batombaka bisendja bi nde ko babikabanaka mabondo manɛi, omɔti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mobeko mo baloma modimedjaka botomba leka lo bato babe.</char></note> na omɔti na i nde ibondo. Batombaka pongono kasaka e nde, yena eda bo pɛ botonga, donga o diko mbunoko nase. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Basoda basabaleanaka: «Lotaekabanaka, bopele lobome djonga tine bodjeba moto waetombake!» Ekɔmɔkɔ bea bɛngi ikomi ikokedjame: «Basakabaneabi bisendja bi mbi ko babomabi djonga tine bisendja<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 22, 19.</char></note> bi mbi.» Endja eka ekɔkɔ basoda.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Mbuti na ekulusu e Yesu edaka nange e nde, ngɛnɛ mwali o nange nde, Malia mwali o Kelopasi ko Malia o Magadala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Ehole enɛkɛ Yesu nange e nde aemi mbuti na motingami opalaka yo; abalaka na nange e nde: «Mwali, endja mwana o wɛ momi!» <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Ngɔngɔ abalaka na motingami: «Endja nange e wɛ.» Oko ta ehole emina, motingami omina amotombaka adi yo.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bogwa bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27, 45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-46">Mlk 15, 33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23, 44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ngɔngɔ imina, elenge Yesu adjebaka boo misusu midaka misiake, abalaka tine bokokedjama bo ikomi: «Naoki posa e madiba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 22, 16.</char></note>!» <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Edaka ena na biseli bilumake na mana ma vino e ngayi. Basoda babokeaka imbusu ta mana ma vino e ngayi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 69, 22.</char></note>, baenangaka na etape e mole mokabebo isɔpi, bamobateaka ta monɔkɔ mo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu atombaka mana ma vino e ngayi emina, ngɔngɔ abalaka: «Misusu mikoki!» Na bea, asuneaka molo ko molema motsweaka.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosoda alusa mopandje mo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Elenge edaka busa bo mosalingo mo busa bo sabata, na bonɔ mɛnɛ sabata emina edaka isu inɛnɛ, bakondji ba bayuda baipalaka mikuku midike mibaki ta ekulusu. Na bea bahɔdjɔkɔ Pilato babuke mako ma bato ibabakama ta ekulusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baipalaka... Sabata </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mib 21, 22-23. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bobuka mako ma bato ibabakama </char></note> ko batitedje mikuku mimina. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Basoda baduaka bobuka mako ma moto o boso obakamaka engbanga na Yesu ta ekulusu, na yona o babae. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ehole eimeabo adi Yesu, bamoenɛ agwaka ehele; na tina emina baimobukaka mako. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Endolo omɔti o basoda amolusaka mopandje na ikɔngɔ i nde, ko makia na madiba maimaka. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Moto oenɛkɛ meako mimina apaka tati ko tati e nde idi soti. Adjebaka boo abalaka soti. Apaka tati emina e bɛngi ino pongono odimeni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ino pongono odimeni </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kaoko, makoma makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ino pongono oyeyoeni ta bodima. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 20, 31.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Na bea, meako mimina mimeaka bɛngi ikomi ikokedjame: «Pɛ nongo mokua mo nde mobukeabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 12, 46; Mit 9, 12; Ndj 34, 21.</char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Ko makomi makina mabali: «Baendjabi yona olusakabo mopandje<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dje 12, 10.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu apuseami</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15, 42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23, 50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ngɔngɔ imina, Esepu, moto o Alimatayo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alimatayo </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 27, 57.</char></note>, asɛngɛkɛ enɔi adi Pilato bɛngi boo atombe mokuku mo Yesu. Esepu adaka omɔti o batingami ba Yesu, endolo ta mbombi tine adaka na bɔɔ bo bakondji ba bayuda. Ko pilato amopaka. Na bea Esepu akɛkɛ atomba mokuku mo Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodɛmɛ, yona okɛkɛ botanea Yesu na bulu, aduaka pongono ko amolwɛkɛ munɛ mobongoanake mbuti na kilo tuku isato i mile ko na aloe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nikodɛmɛ... Akɛkɛ na bulu </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 3, 1-2. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Aloe ko mile</char><char style="fp" closed="false">Munɛ kaoko mosoloa mosu e itindi mokɔmɔ na mole mo aloe na mole mo mile, mosopeaka bayuda ta epasa e esendja epu edingakabo ta mokuku boso bo bomoisa ta ikila.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Na bea batombaka mokuku mo Yesu, bamodingaka na bipasa bi bisendja bipu ko bamosopeaka misoloa mi so e itindi elenge bayuda, ta makɔkɔ ma bobo, bakakɔe ta ehole ekapusebo mikuku mi bobo. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Enakobea edaka na gbie emɔti ta polo ebakaka bo Yesu, edaka ena na ikila iyanie ida bo pɛ bopusea moto boso. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Elenge edaka busa bo mosalingo mo busa bo sabata e bayuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 19, 31.</char></note> ko ikila idaka mbuti, basambeaka mokuku mo Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Bopusoa bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk 16, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Ta ehuma e busa bo eyenga, na mohindihindi, Malia e Magadala akɛkɛ ta ikila. Aenɛkɛ ibanga idongaka ta monɔkɔ mo ikila. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Na bea apotaka tine bokatɔndea Simo Piɛlɛ ko na motingami okina, yona opalaka Yesu. Abalaka na bu: «Badongedji Kumu ta ikila ko lotadjebaka polo emoisibo.» <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Piɛlɛ na motingami okina bakɛkɛ ko baimeaka ta ikila. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Bapotaka bo basusu babae; endolo yona okina motingami apotaka bonɔ Piɛlɛ ko aimeaka boso ta ikila. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Asunamaka tine boendja ko aenɛkɛ bipasa bi bisendja bipu bisambi ena, endolo aikweaka. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simo Piɛlɛ, yona omokimanaka, aimeaka ko akweaka ta tei e ikila. Aenɛkɛ bipasa bi bisendja bipu bisambi ena <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na pongono esendja epu ehuwakabo molo mo Yesu. Esendja emina eidaka polo emɔti na bipasa bia, endolo edingamaka pamba ekina. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Na bea motingami yona okina, yona oimeaka boso ta ikila, akweaka pongono. Aenɛkɛ ko adimaka. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Tengasa batingami baipaka sipoa ikomi ibalaka boo Yesu apusuake ta ndanda e bago<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 16, 10.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ngɔngɔ batingami babae basɔmbɔkɔ adi bo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asenɛmedji na Malia e Magadala</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28, 9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mlk 16, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Malia aemaka mbuti na ikila, sokolu ko adaka boyea. Ehole eeyaka yo, asumanaka tine boindja ta tei e ikila; <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />aenɛkɛ babwɛndji babae balwali bisendja bipu badaka ta polo esambeakabo mokuku mo Yesu, omɔti ta molo, okina ta mako. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Babwɛndji bahɔdjɔkɔ Malia: «Tina aeyaka wɛ nda?» Abasɔmbedjaka: «Badongedji Kumu o mbi ko natadjebaka polo emosambei bo.» <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ngɔngɔ i bobala na bu, ahombanaka ko aenɛkɛ Yesu aemi ena, enakobea aidjebaka boo edaka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Aeyaka wɛ nde, wahombaka nda?» Alɛdjekɛ boo edaka mobanei o gbie, na tina emina abalaka: «Tata, ekada wɛ moto omodongedji, tɔndeani polo emosambei wɛ ko nakɛke amotomba.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Malia!» Ahombanaka ko abalaka na nde na monɔkɔ mo baebele: «Labuni!» Etingodji «Molehi». <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Pɛ bopeani, tengasa naiweakini adi Sesa. Endolo kɛɛ atɔndea bange i mbi boo mbi nakɛi adi Sesa yona odi pongono Sange e bino, adi Ndjakomba o mbi odi pongono Ndjakomba o bino.» <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Na bea, Malia e Magadala akɛkɛ adi batingami ko abatɔndeaka: «Naeni Kumu!» Ko abatɔndeaka misusu imibalaka yo na nde.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asinedji na batingami ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24, 36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Oko ta mɔmɔkɔ momina mo busa bo eyenga, batingami baputoanaka ta ndako. Badipaka bikukɛ na pongola, tengasa badaka na bɔɔ bo bakondji ba Bayuda. Yesu aduaka ko aemaka ta ndanda e bobo. Abalaka na bu: «Bogo bodae na nu!» <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ehole ebalaka yo na bu bea, abainedjaka mɔmɔ ma nde ko na mopandje mo nde. Batingami balumaka na mongandi aboenɛ Kumu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu abalaka na bu naikina: «Bogo bodae na nu! Elenge Sesa alomani yo, mbi pongono nolomakani.» <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ngɔngɔ ibobala bea, abahuweya mohuli ko abalaka na bu: «Asɔni Mwembo Mosɛnɔke! <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Adi bia bayɛkɛbi no mabe ma bobo, bayɛmɛbi; adi bia balonabi no boyɛ mabe ma bobo, mayɛmetebi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mta 16, 19.</char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Enakobea, omɔti o batingami domi na babae, Toma obeakabo ipasa, aidaka engbanga na bu, ehole esenɛmedjaka Yesu na bu. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Batingami bakina bamotɔndeaka: «Iso loeni Kumu!» Endolo Toma abasɔmbedjaka: «Namiti enɛ embete esɛtɛ ta mɔmɔ ma nde na miso ko namiti isa mosapi mo mbi ta polo esɛtɛ ko ebɔ e mbi ta mopandje mo nde, natadimake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 20, 20.</char></note>!»<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Ngɔngɔ i pɔsɛ emɔti, batingami ba Yesu badaka naikina ta ndako, ko Toma adaka engbanga yena na bu. Enakobea bikukɛ bikangamaka na pongola, Yesu akweaka ko aemaka ta ndanda e bobo. Abalaka: «Bogo bodae na nu!» <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Ngɔngɔ abalaka na Toma: «Isa mosapi mo wɛ iya, endja mɔmɔ ma mbi; lindedja ebɔ ko isa mosapi ta mopandje mo mbi. Kina bokakoana endolo dima. Kina kitɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toma amosɔmbedjaka: «Kumu o mbi ko Ndjakomba o mbi!» <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Odimi tine oenini? Sepi adi bia badimake napɛ boenɛni!»<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tina e buku ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu akɔkɔ naikina ta boso bo batingami ba nde bimbete binɛnɛ bi ngindola, ibidama pɛ bokomama ta buku iye. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Endolo imi mikomami, mikomama bɛngi odimeni boo Yesu adi Kilito, Mwana o Ndjakomba. Ko okamodimeani, odiabini bomɔ na kombe e nde.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu asinedji na batingami sambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Ngɔngɔ imina, Yesu asinedjaka naikina adi batingami, ta ibongu i ibeke i Tibelia. Endja moda mosinedjaka yo na bu: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simo Piɛlɛ, Toma, obeakabo ipasa, Natanɛlɛ, odaka moto o Kanana, e ngando e Galilea, bana ba Djebede ko na batingami bakina babae ba Yesu, badaka na bu engbanga. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simo Piɛlɛ amosɔmbedjaka: «Nakɛi aluba.» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Iso pongono, lakɛkɛ na wɛ.» Bakɛkɛ ko batiteaka ta bwato. Endolo baitaedjaka nongo moswi emɔti ta bulu bua. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ehuma mɛnɛ, Yesu aemaka ena, ta ibongu i ibeke, endolo batingami baisipoaka boo edaka Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Bana, oditini nongo na moeka o boyaka?» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Ngasa». <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Abalaka na bu: «Dumbani modjanga ta dɔngɔ i ebɔ e bami e bwato ko wataedjakeni swi.» Na bea badumbaka modjanga ko baihɔnɔkɔ bomotuba ta madiba, tine boo molumaka na swi. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Motingami yona opalaka Yesu abalaka na Piɛlɛ: «Edi Kumu!» Ehole eoka Simo Piɛlɛ kɔpi emina: «Edi Kumu»; alwaka esendja e nde, tine boo ayeihwaka ehole elubaka yo ko asadumbaka ta madiba. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Batingami bakina balindaka bwato mbunoko ibongu ko batubaka modjanga molumake na swi: baidaka bohali na ngondo, mbuti na bamɛtɛlɛ mokama. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ehole esɛmɛkɛ bo o ngondo, bataneaka mosa mo maalo na swi batumbake ko na mwɛmbɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Duani na ndambo e swi etaedji no.» <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simo Piɛlɛ atiteaka ta bwato ko atubaka modjanga o ngondo molumake na swi ba gbɔbgɔ: mokama na tuku itano na basato. Nongo bonɛnɛ boswi imina, mondjanga moiyaleanaka. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Dua ayakeni.» Pɛ nongo motingami omohɔdjɔkɔ: «Wɛ nda?» Tengasa badjebaka boo edaka Kumu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu abatamaka, atombaka mwɛmbɛ ko abakabaneaka; akɔkɔ bea pongono na moswi. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Yena edaka mbala e basato e Yesu bosinedja na batingami ba nde, donga ta bopusoa bo nde ta tei e bago.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Piɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ngɔngɔ iboyaka, Yesu ahɔdjɔkɔ Simo Piɛlɛ: «Simo, mwana o Yoane, wapalakani bonɔ iluu losusu?» Asɔmbedjaka: «Okobea Mokondji, odjebi bopele boo nakopale.» Yesu abalaka na nde: «Banea bhata ba mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Abalaka na nde mbala e babae: «Simo, mwana o Yoane, wapalakani?» Asombedjaka: «Okobea Kumu, odjebi bopele boo nakopale.» Yesu abalaka na nde: «Banea bhata ba mbi.» <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Ngɔngɔ amohɔdjɔkɔ naikina mbala e basato: «Simo, mwana o Yoane, wapalakani?» Na bea Piɛlɛ alumaka na ndjokwa na mahɔdjɔ mamohɔdjɔkɔ Yesu mbala i sato: «Wapalakani?» Ko asɔmbedjaka: «Kumu okadjebe meako misusu; odjebi boo nakopale!» Yesu abalaka na nde: «Banea bhata ba mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bik 20, 28; 1Pi 5, 2.</char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Okobea, nabalaka na wɛ, edi soti: ehole edaka wɛ yɛngɛ, osanangaka mosenge wɛ mɛnɛ ko okɛkɛ ta polo ipalaka wɛ. Endolo ehole eimeake wɛ mobange, waninodjake mɔmɔ ma wɛ, okina moto aolwadjake mosenge ko akɛke na wɛ ta polo edi wɛ pɛ boda na posa e bokɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Abalaka bea tine boinedja moda mo bogwa bo Piɛlɛ agwake yo tine bokumedja Ndjakomba. Na bea Yesu abalaka na nde: «Kimanani!»<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na motingami opalamaka yo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Piɛlɛ asahombedjaka ko aenɛkɛ ta sangɔngɔ i bobo, motingami opalaka Yesu ko oekɛmɛkɛ adi Yesu ta ehole e boyaka. Yo ahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu: «Kumu, yona wokabake nda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 13, 25.</char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Ehole emoenɛkɛ Piɛlɛ, abalaka na Yesu: «Kumu ibea yo, eka amoimeake nda?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Nakapala bo ayeyoe oko ta bodua bo mbi, mo wɛ nda? Wɛ, kimanani!» <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Na bea gala enanganaka ta ndanda e badimi boo motingami omina agwɛtebi. Enakobea Yesu aibalaka na Piɛlɛ bea: «Agwɛtebi,» Endolo abalaka: «Nakapala ayeyoe mbunoko bodua bo mbi, edi na modjɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makoma makina maditi na kombedji </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Pɛ bosatungeani. </char></note>?»<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Edi oko motingami yona opaka tati e meako imi misusu ko yo amikomaka. Ko iso lodjebi boo tati e nde idi soti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja 19, 35.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ta bosukedja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yesu akɔkɔ meako mikina minɛnɛ. Basobamikoma momɔti na momɔti na meako mimina misusu, nalɛdjɛkɛ boo buku isusu ipalaka bo bokoma, ikɔkɔ koka bokwea ta ngondo esusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 20, 30.</char></note>.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>